msgid "刘安禄"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "刘兄弟在寒舍管事已经五年了，过去之事不须再提。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你既然知道我是柳馆主，怎麽不知道我是柳淳风？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.here
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这里便是淳风武馆。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "隘口"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.隘口
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "听说大内的人在黄石隘口挖出了东西，又被人抢了去。抢东西的若是往老松岭去了，多半是投老松寨。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.老松寨
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "老松寨的常老大，人称泼风刀王，什么钱都收。要过他的寨门，带够银子；有本事的，就在寨门外叫阵——硬闯的人，没几个回来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry topic
#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader inquiry topic
#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.black_taoist_pass name
#. native.npc.black_taoist name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/oldpine/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣道士"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.黑衣道士
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠黑衣的道士？这一带没有道观。你若在老松岭遇上，小心些，那种人下手没有分寸。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "信已经给你了。去水烟阁找潘军禅，他是我的结拜义弟，见信如见我。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "听你说完山洞里的事，沉默了半晌。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前，振远镖局押一趟镖过老松岭，镖师随从一个都没回来。镖局丢了脸，陈剑秋到今天都不肯提。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "那具骸骨若真是水烟阁的人，这事就该问水烟阁。我写一封信，你拿去给执法使潘军禅，他是我的结拜义弟。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "提笔写了一封信，封好了交给你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "先去绮云镇问问陈剑秋，把镖单要来。上了山，别带着兵刃进阁。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁在青石官道西头的山上，武者同盟的总坛。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master apprentice.refuse_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "学剑之人必须胆大心细，依我看$RESPECT的资质似乎不宜？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "很好，$RESPECT多加努力，他日必定有成。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison name
#. quests.target
#: data/common/npcs.json data/common/quests.json
msgid "县城官兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是个正在执行公务的县城官兵，虽然和许多武林人物比起来，官兵\n"
"们的武功实在稀松平常，但是他们是有组织、有纪律的战士，谁也不\n"
"轻易地招惹他们。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"县城官兵喝道：还不快放下武器束手就缚？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"县城官兵喝道：大胆刁民竟敢拒捕？反了！反了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "大天邪"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁传功使"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武是当今皇上的叔父，但是他毕生浸淫武学，甘愿抛弃荣华富\n"
"以换取水烟阁传功使一职，以便阅读水烟阁中所藏的武学典籍，无论\n"
"你有什麽武学上的疑难，他都能为你解答。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.武学
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"武学之道....嗯....只可意会，不可言喻。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.水烟阁
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"水烟阁乃是历届武林盟主的行馆，你有什麽事要见武林盟主？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.拜师
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"哦....老夫向来有个规矩，凡是想拜我为师的，得接我三招不死，你想试试？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.ask_say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.ask_say
#: data/common/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "$RESPECT若真的有心，不妨让我看看你的所学"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.ask_tell
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.ask_tell
#: data/common/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "如果想拜师的话，就请接受测试"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武点了点头，说道：很好，这是第一招...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.fail
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武叹了口气，说道：连第一招都撑不过，真是自不量力...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武说道：这是第二招...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.fail
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武「哼」地一声，说道：便是有这许多不怕死的家伙...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武说道：第三招来了...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.fail
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武叹道：可惜，难道老夫一身武功竟无传人...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.success
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武哈哈大笑，说道：今日老夫终於觅得一个可造之才！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "萧辟尘"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "小天邪"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"萧辟尘自幼生长於岚城之中，看起来仙风道骨，不食人间烟火。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.armed
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "{respect}既然使兵刃，在下空手接招未免不敬。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.armed
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "进招吧！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.unarmed
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "既然{respect}不使兵刃，在下自然奉陪！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.unarmed_many
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "嗯... 既然{count}位都是空手，在下理当奉陪！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.ask_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我天邪派门规甚严，$RESPECT如果真的有心，且发个誓来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.again_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "多说无益，若不发誓恪守门规，便是跪著求我也没用。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.oath
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "守门规"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这就是了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "潘军禅"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "书 剑 侠"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁执法使"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"潘军禅是当今武林的一位传奇性人物，以他仅仅二十八岁的年龄竟能做到\n"
"水烟阁执法使的职位，著实是一位不简单的人物。潘军禅是封山剑派掌门\n"
"柳淳风的结拜义弟，但是他为人其实十分风趣，又好交朋友，丝毫不会摆\n"
"出武林执法者的架子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.柳淳风
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "柳大哥？他是我的结拜义兄。你有他的信？拿来我看。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "阁里那把是假的，真剑不在这儿。要找去年那个道士，往野羊山北麓去。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "看了柳淳风的信，笑了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "柳大哥的朋友就是我的朋友。邪剑穿灵？阁里挂着的那把，是仿的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "真剑早就不在水烟阁了。挂一把假的，是鱼饵——钓那些冲着它来的人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "去年就钓上来一个：黑衣黑冠的道士，夜里来试剑，发觉是假的就走了。我的人跟到野羊山北麓，跟丢了。那边没有道观，只有一片黑砖。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "执法使的佩剑，也是你问得的？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry topic
#. main.chapter4 title
#. waterfog.npc.elder5 inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.guest inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.tguest inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/story/chapter4.json data/waterfog/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄。守它的人不白给——我说过了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "寒於宝衣？你倒问到点子上了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "当年三件东西各归一处，宝衣归月神族保管。月神族早没了，只剩晚月庄那些女子——自称人灵区冥的后人，庄里供着她的神像，池边立着凤凰护庄。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "衣在不在庄里，我不知道。守它的人不白给——你去了就明白。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "执刑使管的是刀，不管衣裳。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绝尘子"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绝尘子本为释家人，后得奇人指点，得悟道家真谛，佛道双修，\n"
"皆入化境。后访遍名山大川，自号绝尘，创此绝尘一派。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master family.title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "祖师"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
