"绝尘子道：你为何无故滋事，误我清修！\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绝尘子道：贫道向以遁世为乐，你何苦如此相逼？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry.绝尘派
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绝尘派是我所创，你有何指教？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry.拜师
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "入我派者，需有慧根。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry.name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我便是绝尘子。"
msgstr ""

