#. common.npc.dancer.master name
#. cloud.npc.lm_guard inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/cloud/npcs.json
msgid "蓝止萍"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "回音仙子"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄主"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝止萍是一个十分出色的美女，她弹的一手琵琶更是闻名千里，许多\n"
"王侯子弟，富商豪客都为她天下无双的美貌与琴艺倾倒。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master family.title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "庄主"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝止萍嫣然一笑，一个转身迳自舞了起来，对眼前这场恶斗似乎全不放在心上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝止萍脚步轻移，翩翩地转了几个圈，回眸一笑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝止萍用手扶了扶自己的发簪，像是怕被对手碰歪似地。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝止萍笑嘻嘻地拾起地上一片从魔鞭翩珑上落下的花瓣。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master chat_msg_combat.tell
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你觉得脸上似乎沾上了什麽东西，伸手一摸却什麽也没有。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "男人都不是好东西，滚开！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "很好，只要你对本庄主忠心耿耿，好处是少不了的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.dancer.master apprentice.accept_vision.line
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "$N暧昧地抚摸著$n的脸，说道：特别是像你这样的女孩 ...."
msgstr ""

