msgid "去去去去去.. 我又不是收破烂的..."
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.drunk accept_object.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "真没诚意, 剩么一点... "
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.drunk accept_object.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "多谢, 不过我还有酒... "
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.drunk accept_object.whisper
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"听说沈记商行有在卖蒙汗药...\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.drunk accept_object.whisper
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"嗯.. 你是想问我玉佩的事吧? 我卖给沈老板了, 那东西不吉祥...\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.drunk accept_object.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "多谢啦....."
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.scavenger long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这个人不但自己收破烂，身上也穿得破烂不堪。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.scavenger chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"收破烂的吆喝道：收～破～烂～哪～\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.scavenger chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"收破烂的嘴里嘟哝著，不知道说些什么。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.scavenger chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"收破烂的伸手捉住了身上的虱子，一脚踩得扁扁的。 \n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.scavenger accept_fight.say
#. snow.npc.beggar accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "$RESPECT饶命！小的这就离开！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.scavenger accept_object.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "多谢这位$RESPECT！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard title
#. city.npc.shangshu.guard name
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid "门房"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄是淳风武馆的门房，除了馆主柳淳风没有人知道他的出身来历，只知\n"
"到他的武艺不弱，一手快刀在这一带罕有敌手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄说道：你当这里是什么地方，敢来这里撒野？\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄说道：想我堂堂....呃....连我这个淳风武馆的小小的门房都可以收拾你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄忽然挥出一刀，招数精奇，但是刀到中途忽然像是想起什么，急忙收招。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄说道：你快走吧，就算我输了你啦....\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "刘老三"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.刘老三.rules.say
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.血手刘三.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "……老子认了，还问什么。你要问野羊寨的事，问大寨主。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.刘老三.rules.say
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.血手刘三.rules.say
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "老子就是血手刘三，血手刘三就是你老子！纳命来！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.刘老三.rules.say
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.血手刘三.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "我...不知道！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.刘老三.rules.lines.line
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.血手刘三.rules.lines.line
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄眼中突然放出异样的光芒，颤声说道：看来...你都知道了？"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.刘老三.rules.lines.line
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.血手刘三.rules.lines.line
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄大喝一声，叫道：既然如此，老子今天豁出去了，纳命来！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.刘老三.rules.lines.line
#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.血手刘三.rules.lines.line
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄使开单刀，招数精奇，沈猛狠辣，和刚才简直判若两人！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry topic
#. snow.npc.guard moods.spared.nickname
#. snow.npc.guard moods.revealed.nickname
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "血手刘三"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry topic
#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "大寨主"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.lines.line
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄沉默了半晌，低声道：野羊寨的大寨主霍铮，是我拜过把子的大哥。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.lines.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "半年前，北麓那座黑砖道观的道士上山要人。大哥跟他们走了，再没回来。那伙人自称逆灵宫。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.lines.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "黄霸——老三——把寨子接了过去，每年给道观纳供，金帛、牲口，要什么送什么。我不肯伺候那群臭道士，就下了山。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.lines.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "纳供的车这几天就上山。到了山路转角，道士从北边山壁的裂口把东西吊上去——道观就在裂口上头。你要去，替我看一眼大哥。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "……大哥的事，等你知道野羊山北麓是个什么地方再说。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard inquiry.大寨主.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "大寨主？我是淳风武馆的门房，哪来的什么大寨主。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard moods.spared.title
#. snow.npc.guard moods.revealed.title
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山寨二寨主"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard moods.spared.chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄望着北边，低声道：大哥……\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.guard moods.revealed.combat_chat_msg.action
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "random_move"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.trainee long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你看到一位身材高大的汉子，正在辛苦地操练著。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer title
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "拳法教练"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"李火狮是个孔武有力的大块头，他正在训练他的弟子们习练「柳家拳\n"
"法」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer inquiry.here
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这里当然是淳风武馆，不然还是哪里？\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer inquiry.name
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"在下姓李，名字就叫火狮，人称李教头的便是我。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "柳家拳法"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer inquiry.柳家拳法
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"哦....说来惭愧，小弟这套拳法还没学得到家, 柳馆主就教我在这里传艺。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer accept_fight.emote
#. temple.npc.trainer accept_fight.emote
#. temple.npc.tfighter accept_fight.emote
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.lines.emote
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/temple/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "点了点头。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer accept_fight.say
#. temple.npc.trainer accept_fight.say
#. temple.npc.tfighter accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/temple/npcs.json
msgid "进招吧。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "馆主吩咐过，不许和来这里的客人过招。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer recognize_apprentice.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "对不起，这位$RESPECT，您不是我们武馆的弟子。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.fist_trainer recognize_apprentice.fail
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "李火狮不愿意教你拳法。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.farmer long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你看到一位面色黝黑的农夫。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.farmer chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"农夫叫道：杀人哪！杀人哪！\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.farmer chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"农夫叫道：有土匪哪！光天化日下打劫哪！\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.crazy_dog long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一只浑身脏兮兮的野狗，一双眼睛正恶狠狠地瞪著你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher title
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "教书先生"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"魏无极是个博学多闻的教书先生，他年轻时曾经中过举人，但是\n"
"因为生性喜爱自由而不愿做官，魏无极以教书为业，如果你付他\n"
"一笔学费，就可以成为他的弟子学习读书识字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "学费"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.学费
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "嗯 ... 读书识字是做人的第一步。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.学费
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "学好了读书识字的本领，胜过于百万的家财。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.学费
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "所以说学问是金钱买不到的。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.学费
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "虽然学问是无价的，不过如果你有心的话 ..."
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.学费
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "只要五两银子。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.学费
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "手头紧？街东头的谷场正缺短工，干一回给一两。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.读书识字
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "对，读书识字。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "哦 ... 你是说野羊山寨的二寨主，人称血手刘三的刘安禄吗？"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "他又出来做恶了？"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "你带我去见他，让我跟他说几句话。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher accept_object.emote
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "点了点头，说道：哦，向你这么有心的学生还真是不多见，好好努力将来必定前途无量，谢了。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher accept_object.emote
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "点了点头，说道：很好，从今天起你随时可以来问我有关读书识字(literate)的任何问题。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher accept_object.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "你的诚意不够，这钱还是拿回去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.teacher recognize_apprentice.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "咦？我不记得收过你这个学生啊...."
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.woodcutter long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你看到一个粗壮的大汉，身上穿著普通樵夫的衣服。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.woodcutter chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"樵夫说道：野羊山那群臭道士真是该千刀万剐....\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.woodcutter chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"樵夫说道：不知道那些牛鼻子施了什么妖法，前天回家差点迷了路。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.woodcutter chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"樵夫说道：唉....日子越来越不好过罗。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer title
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "雪亭驿长"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"杜宽担任雪亭驿的驿长已经有十几年了，虽然期间有几次升迁的\n"
"机会，但是他都因为舍不得离开这个小山村而放弃了，雪亭镇的\n"
"居民对杜宽的风评相当不错，常常会来到驿站跟他聊天。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/snow/voxel/postoffice_house.json
msgid "驿站"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.驿站
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "是啊... 这里就是雪亭驿，你要寄信吗？"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.驿站
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "官府的信差都改走飞鸢栈道了，咱这儿如今只剩百姓的信。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "送信"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.送信.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "往后有信，还找你。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.送信.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "送到了？好，说好的脚钱。往后有信，还找你。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.送信.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "信送到了么？陈镖头的镖局就在绮云镇街上。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.送信.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "正好有封信，要送到绮云镇振远镖局陈镖头手里。驿里就我一个走不开——你若肯跑这一趟，回来给你一两脚钱。出镇往南过卧龙岗，岗上有强人，别跟他们纠缠，走你的路就是。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "悬赏"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.post_officer inquiry.悬赏
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "门外那张榜是乔阴府发的悬赏。榜上的恶人要是教你拿住了，赏银照榜发——拿不住也别逞强。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.rat name
#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "老鼠"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.rat long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一只贼头贼脑的大老鼠。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter name
#. city.npc.waiter name
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid "店小二"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter long
#. city.npc.waiter long
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这位店小二正笑咪咪地忙著，还不时拿起挂在脖子上的抹布擦脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter rank_info.respect
#. city.npc.waiter rank_info.respect
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid "小二哥"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter greeting.one_of.emote
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "笑咪咪地说道：这位$RESPECT，进来喝杯茶，歇歇腿吧。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter greeting.one_of.emote
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "用脖子上的毛巾抹了抹手，说道：这位$RESPECT，请进请进。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter greeting.one_of.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "这位$RESPECT，进来喝几盅小店的红酒吧，这几天才从窖子里开封的哟。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.老鼠.rules.say
#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.老鼠.rules.lines.say
#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.楼上.rules.say
#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.楼上.rules.lines.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "鸡腿骨头别扔，东街那两条野狗见了骨头就跟人走，怪得很。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.老鼠.rules.lines.say
#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.楼上.rules.lines.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "哟，可算清净了！来，刚烤好的鸡腿，小店的一点心意。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.老鼠.rules.say
#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.楼上.rules.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "唉，别提了。楼上几间客房闹老鼠，客人嫌吵，掌柜的又舍不得请人。这位$RESPECT要是肯上去收拾收拾，小店请您吃顿热的。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "楼上"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "官爷"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.官爷
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "外头广场上来了官爷，一队白衣的武官，还有两位老者坐着，说是大内来的高手。这位$RESPECT要是闲，去瞧瞧热闹也好。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.waiter inquiry.官爷
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "小哥您有所不知，这些个爷儿们是奉了咱们皇上的命令，要去岚城找一把叫做什麽『旋芒宝剑』的。他们等的白道长，便是咱们这附近有名的太乙观观主。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir title
#. city.npc.microsof title
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid "钱庄老板"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安惜迩是个看起来相当斯文的年轻人，不过有时候会有些心不在焉的\n"
"样子，雪亭镇的居民对安惜迩都觉得有点神秘莫测的感觉，为什么他\n"
"年纪轻轻就身为一家大钱庄的老板，还有他一身稀奇古怪的武功，所\n"
"幸安惜迩似乎天性恬淡，甚至有些隐者的风骨，只要旁人不去惹他，\n"
"他也绝不会去招惹旁人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir chat_msg_combat.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安惜迩似笑非笑地望著你，脸上的神气古理古怪，不知道在想些什么？\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir chat_msg_combat.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安惜迩的身影晃了一下，似乎在你身上各处大穴摸了一下，不过也许是你的错觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir chat_msg_combat.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安惜迩神情忽然严肃了起来，不过好像是在想自己的事，与你无关。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir chat_msg_combat.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安惜迩忽然呵呵呵地笑了起来，却不知道在笑些什么....\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.annihir accept_fight.say
#. city.npc.microsof accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid "咦... 要打就真打吧，光是较量多没意思？"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"王铁匠正用铁钳夹住一块红热的铁块放进炉中。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry.name
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"小人姓王，单名一个恒字，可是小人西瓜大的字识不到一担，只有王字会写。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry.here
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这里是小人糊口的铺子，小人一家五口都住在后边的屋子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "锄头"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry.锄头
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"锄头... 抱歉，锄头已经卖光了...\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "铲子"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry.铲子
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"对不起，小人店里的铲子都给人订走了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.smith inquiry.铁锤
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"铁锤？小人做的铁锤坚固又耐用，一把只要三百文钱。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.herbalist name
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "杨掌柜"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.herbalist long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"杨掌柜是这附近相当有名的大善人，常常施舍草药给付不起药钱的穷人\n"
"。此外他的医术也不错，年轻时曾经跟著山烟寺的玄智和尚学医，一般\n"
"的伤寒小病直接问他开药吃比医生还灵。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "治伤"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry.治伤.eff_kee_percent.say
#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry.疗伤.eff_kee_percent.say
#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry.开药.eff_kee_percent.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "这位$RESPECT，您看起来气色很好啊，不像有受伤的样子。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry.治伤.eff_kee_percent.say
#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry.疗伤.eff_kee_percent.say
#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry.开药.eff_kee_percent.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "哦....我看看....只是些皮肉小伤，您买包金创药回去敷敷就没事了。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.herbalist inquiry topic
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "开药"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.girl long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳绘心是淳风武馆馆主柳淳风的独生女。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.girl chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳绘心秀眉微蹙，说道：喂！我哪里得罪你了？干嘛这样跟我拼死拼活？\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.girl chat_msg_combat
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳绘心不住地望著窗外：你还是快走吧，我没空陪你练功夫！\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.girl accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "师姐！别整天想著练功嘛，我们去花园摘花儿玩嘛？"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.girl accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "我才不要，你们去找李教头练吧！"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.girl accept_fight.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "爹爹说过，不能跟你们这些江湖人物比武过招。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.beggar long
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个满脸风霜之色的老乞丐。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.beggar chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"乞丐说道：好心的大爷哪～ 赏我要饭的几文钱吧～\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.beggar chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"乞丐懒洋洋地打了个哈欠。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.beggar chat_msg
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid ""
"乞丐伸手捉住了身上的虱子，骂道：老子身上没几两肉，全叫你们给咬糜了。 \n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.npc.beggar accept_object.say
#: data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "多谢这位$RESPECT，您好心一定会有好报的！"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/inn long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在雪亭镇南边的一家小客栈里，这家客栈虽小，却是方圆\n"
"五百里内最负盛名的一家，客栈的主人据说是一位云游四海的仙人，如果\n"
"你的福缘深厚的话，也许可以在这里遇到他。除此之外，来自各地的旅人\n"
"都喜欢聚集在这里交换旅途上的见闻，你也可以在这里打听到许多有趣的\n"
"消息。靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌(sign)。\n"
"西北边有一个红木门(door)，门上泛著一层白色的光晕，一种令人感觉\n"
"很有力量，又很柔和的光芒。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/square long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是雪亭镇镇前广场的空地，地上整齐地铺著大石板。广场中央有\n"
"一个木头搭的架子，经过多年的风吹日晒雨淋，看来非常破旧。四周建筑\n"
"林立。往西你可以看到一间客栈，看来生意似乎很好。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/sroad1 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是雪亭镇的街道，往北是一个热闹的广场，南边是条小路通往\n"
"一座林子，东边则有一条小径沿著山腰通往山上，往西是一条比较窄的\n"
"街道，参差不齐的瓦屋之间传来几声犬吠。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/eroad1 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条普通的黄土小径，弯弯曲曲往东一路盘旋上山，北边有\n"
"一间城隍庙，往西则是雪亭镇的街道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/eroad2 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条普通的黄土小径，小径往西南通往一处山间的平地，从这\n"
"里可以望见不少房屋错落在平地上，往北则一路上山。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/eroad3 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条说宽不宽，说窄倒也不窄的山路，路面用几块生满青苔的\n"
"大石铺成，西面是一段坡地，从这里可以望见西边有几间房屋错落在林\n"
"木间，东面则是山壁，山路往西衔接一条黄土小径，往北则是通往山\n"
"上的石阶。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/temple long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间十分老旧的城隍庙，在你面前的神桌上供奉著一尊红脸的城\n"
"隍，庙虽老旧，但是神案四周已被香火薰成乌黑的颜色，显示这里必定相\n"
"当受到信徒的敬仰。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/mstreet1 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在雪亭镇的街道上，东边不远处有一间高大的院子，门\n"
"口立著一根粗大的旗杆，旗子上写著「淳风武馆」，往南只听得人声鼎\n"
"沸，是个五十尺见方的广场，人来人往相当热闹。往北可望见一座牌坊\n"
"，年代久远，上面的字迹早已看不出是什么字，出了牌坊就是镇外。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/mstreet2 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在雪亭镇的大街，往南直走不远处是镇上的广场，在你\n"
"的东边是一间大宅院，不过正门不在这个方向，往西是一家打铁铺子，\n"
"叮叮当当的声音大老远可以听得到，街道往北边一直通往镇外。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/mstreet3 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是雪亭镇的大街，东边有一栋陈旧的建筑，看起来像是什么店\n"
"铺，但是并没有任何招牌，只有一扇门(door)上面写著一个大大的「当\n"
"」字，往西是一间药铺，大街往南北两个方向延伸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/mstreet4 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是雪亭镇的大街，一条小巷子通往东边，西边则是一间驿站，\n"
"由于雪亭镇来往的商旅、官员并不很多，因此虽然是官府的驿站，也接\n"
"受百姓的信件，大街往北是一处山坳，从这里远远地可以望见北方的野\n"
"羊山，出了山坳就是一条碎石路通往山上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/crossroad long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一处山坳，往南就是雪亭镇，一条蜿蜒的小径往东通往另一\n"
"个邻近的小山村，一块官府立的告示牌立在路旁，上面写著有关野羊山\n"
"土匪出没的警告标志。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/workplace long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间谷物加工厂，这里是谷子脱壳成米的地方。米厂老板是一个一\n"
"看就知道是十分精明的干瘦的中年人，老是带着一脸奸笑。你可以看到\n"
"许多人正在忙忙碌碌的工作着，门口挂著一块牌子(sign)，往西是通往\n"
"雪亭镇大街的大门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/bank long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间素来以公平信用著称的钱庄，钱庄的老板还是个曾经中过\n"
"举人的读书人，你可以看到钱庄里里外外都打扫得乾乾净净，一个胖胖\n"
"的中年人坐在柜台后面，柜台上放著一块牌子(sign)，往东是通往雪亭\n"
"镇大街的大门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/hockshop long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一家中等规模的当铺，老旧的柜台上放著一张木牌(sign)，屋\n"
"里的光线不是很亮，往东的出口被一块蓝色布帘遮著，上面有「非请莫\n"
"入」的字样，西边有一扇木雕门(door)通往大街。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/school1 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一间大宅院的入口，两只巨大的石狮镇守在大门的两\n"
"侧，一阵阵吆喝与刀剑碰撞的声音从院子中传来。通过红漆大门(door)\n"
"往东可以望见许多身穿灰衣的汉子正在操练。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/school2 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一个宽敞的教练场中，地上铺著黄色的细砂，许多人\n"
"正在这里努力地操练著，北边是一间高大的兵器厅，往东则是武馆师父\n"
"们休息的大厅。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/schoolhall long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是淳风武馆的正厅，五张太师椅一字排开面对著门口，这是武\n"
"馆中四位大师傅与馆主柳淳风的座位，和一般武馆不同的是，墙上竟然\n"
"挂著几幅风骨颇为不俗的书画，显示这里的主人并非大字不识的粗汉，\n"
"而是文武双全的高人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/sroad2 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是雪亭镇的街道，你的北边有一家客栈，从这里就可以听到客\n"
"栈里人们饮酒谈笑的声音，街道往东不远处有个转角往北，如果你往东\n"
"直走就是上山的小径了，往西则可以走到车马来往络绎不绝的官道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/sroad3 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板铺成的大道，路上车马的痕迹已经在路\n"
"面上留下一条条明显的凹痕，往东是一条较小的街道通往雪亭镇，大路\n"
"从这里往北可达水烟阁，往西南穿过黄石隘口则通往戍守京畿重地的天\n"
"驼关。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/sroad4 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板大道，大道两旁种著整齐的花木，从这\n"
"里往北通往水烟阁，往东则是衔接雪亭镇街道的路口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/sroad5 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板大道，大道两旁种著整齐的花木，从这\n"
"里往西通往水烟阁，往南则是衔接雪亭镇街道的路口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/school long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一间宽敞的书院，虽然房子看起来很老旧了，但是打扫得很\n"
"整洁。墙壁上挂著一幅山水画，意境颇为不俗。书院的大门开在北边，\n"
"西边有一扇木门通往边厢。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/smithy long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一间打铁铺子，从火炉中冒出的火光将墙壁映得通红，屋子\n"
"的角落里堆满了各式铁器的完成品或未完成品，像是锄头、铁锤、铲子\n"
"等，叮叮当当的声音敲得满屋子响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/herbshop long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一间规模不小的药铺，奇怪的是，在这里你闻不到一丝药铺\n"
"应有的药味，有的只是一股淡淡的檀香，令人觉得心旷神怡，药铺的柜\n"
"台就在店铺靠北的一面，柜台后是一个巨大的药柜(cabinet)， 上面的\n"
"小抽屉只怕有七、八百个之多，但是全部没有贴标签，药铺的出口在东\n"
"边，柜台上贴著一张发黄的纸片(sign)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/postoffice long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是负责雪亭镇官府文书跟军令往来的雪亭驿，但是因为出了雪\n"
"亭镇往北的野羊山近年来有盗匪盘据，官府的信差最近都改走东边的飞\n"
"鸢栈道，所以雪亭驿来往的人就少了，驿站的官员索性就开始接一些百\n"
"姓的信件，一方面打发时间，一方面也有点事做以免被上级裁撤。驿站\n"
"大门口上悬著一块木牌(sign)，上面写了些字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/hockshop2 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是丰登当铺的储藏室，有时候当铺里的大朝奉会把铺里存不下\n"
"的死当货物拿出来拍卖，不过你现在只能看见一个个锁著的箱子。往西\n"
"边穿过一道布帘可以回到当铺店面。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/inn_2f short
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid "饮风客栈二楼"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/inn_2f long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在来到了饮风客栈的二楼，这家客栈有个很奇怪的规矩，就是只留宿\n"
"名头够大的客人，如果你只是一个无名小卒，不论出再多银两都租不到一间空\n"
"房，墙边有一道楼梯通往一楼的茶座。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/n_room long
#. es2:d/snow/e_room long
#. es2:d/snow/w_room long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间打扫得相当乾净的客房，虽然所有的家俱看起来都相当朴\n"
"素，比不上县城里几家著名的大酒馆，但是自有一种敦厚亲切的感觉，\n"
"你在这里相信可以安心的休息。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/inneryard long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是淳风武馆中的天井，往西走可以回到正厅，往北边是书房，\n"
"南边是招待客人的厢房，往东一条长廊通往武馆内院，天井中种满了许\n"
"多奇花异草，中央立著一根石柱(pillar)，上面似乎刻著字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/innerhall long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是淳风武馆的内院，平常武馆弟子没有馆主的允许是不敢到这\n"
"里来的，往东是柳家的祠堂，馆主和家眷的卧房分别位于往北一条走道\n"
"的两旁，厨房以及柴房、仆役的卧房都在往南的走道两旁，往西则是天\n"
"井。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/guestroom long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一间布置得相当雅致的厢房，从窗子可以看到北边的天井跟\n"
"南边的庭园中各式各样的奇花异草，以及他们所带来的淡淡香气，厢房\n"
"的东面墙上还挂著一幅仕女图(painting)，画中是一位宫装美妇，往西\n"
"是通往天井的出口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/nyard long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一间整理得相当乾净的书房，红木桌椅上铺著蓝绸巾，显得\n"
"十分考究，西面的立著一个书架，上面放著一排排的古书，往南走出房\n"
"门可以看到天井。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/weapon_storage long
#: data/snow/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间堆满各式兵器、刀械的储藏室，各式武器都依照种类、长\n"
"短、依次放在一起，并且擦拭得一尘不染，储藏室的出口在你的南边，\n"
"面对出口的左手边有一个架子(shelf)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/snow/secret_storage long
#. es2:d/city/midao1 long
#: data/snow/rooms.json data/city/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一间窄小的密室，你的面前只有一个破旧的小床(bed)跟一\n"
"些乾草。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.workplace.mill name
#: data/snow/world.json
msgid "短工"
msgstr ""

#. snow.bank.counter name
#. city.bank.counter name
#: data/snow/world.json data/city/world.json data/snow/voxel/bank_house.json
msgid "钱庄"
msgstr ""

#. snow.school.gate name
#: data/snow/world.json
msgid "红漆大门"
msgstr ""

#. snow.hockshop.door name
#. cloud.tearoom.door name
#: data/snow/world.json data/cloud/world.json
msgid "木雕门"
msgstr ""

#. snow.inn_2f.north_door name
#. snow.inn_2f.east_door name
#. snow.inn_2f.west_door name
#: data/snow/world.json
msgid "房门"
msgstr ""

#. snow.weapon_storage.landmark.shelf action
#: data/snow/world.json
msgid "往左推"
msgstr ""

#. snow.weapon_storage.landmark.shelf long
#: data/snow/world.json
msgid ""
"这个架子上空荡荡的，什么都没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. snow.weapon_storage.landmark.shelf messages.push
#: data/snow/world.json
msgid "你将架子往左推...，忽然「喀」一声架子又移回原位。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.weapon_storage.landmark.shelf messages.open
#. city.jitan.landmark.button messages.open
#: data/snow/world.json data/city/world.json
msgid "地板忽然发出轧轧的声音，一块地面缓缓移动著，露出一个向下的阶梯。"
msgstr ""

#. snow.weapon_storage.landmark.shelf messages.close
#. city.jitan.landmark.button messages.close
#: data/snow/world.json data/city/world.json
msgid "地板忽然发出轧轧的声音，一块地面缓缓移动著，将向下的通道盖住了。"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/npath1 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条林间的小路，往北不远处走出这座林子就是雪亭\n"
"镇，小路两旁长满了许多高耸的松树，雪亭镇的居民都把这里叫做「老\n"
"松林」，据说林子里有株树龄上千的老松树，颇有灵验。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/npath2 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条林间的小路上，小路两旁长满了高耸的松树，从\n"
"林间传来阵阵鸟叫声，小路往南北两个方向延伸出去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/npath3 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条林间的小路上，小路往东似乎通往一处空地，林\n"
"子到了这里变得静悄悄的，小路两旁的松树也比西边的矮小，看起来有\n"
"点营养不良的样子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/clearing long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一块林间空地，四周的树木花草像是被人修剪过一般，环绕著\n"
"空地围成一个整齐的圆形，空地中央一株巨大的松树(pine)像平地上撑\n"
"起一把大伞，树上针叶茂密得遮去了大半的阳光，空地四周有三条小路\n"
"分别通往东、西、南三个方向，往南的小路旁竖著一个牌子(sign)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/spath1 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一片松树林中的小路上，小路往北通往一处空地，一\n"
"株巨大无朋的松树矗立在空地中央，小路往南是一条长长的下坡道，这\n"
"条路上足迹很多，显然常有人经过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/spath2 short
#. es2:d/oldpine/spath3 short
#. es2:d/oldpine/spath4 short
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid "下坡道"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/spath2 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/spath3 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/spath4 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条笔直的坡道，北高南低，道路两旁长满了许多松树，从松\n"
"林间隐约可以听到东边传来流水的声音。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/epath1 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条松树林中的小路，这里的松树树干上都有著一些\n"
"奇怪的记号，像是被人用刀子划过，小路的西边是一块空地，往东不远\n"
"可以看到一条山涧，上面横跨著一座小石桥。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/epath2 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一座长满青苔的古桥上，桥下是一条山涧，几股清泉\n"
"在乱石之中向山下奔流，桥北边不远处有一个瀑布(waterfall) ，从山\n"
"壁上犹如一条白练般垂了下来，瀑布两旁的石壁十分陡峭，高度和山涧\n"
"旁的松林相差了近三、四十丈。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/epath3 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条松树林间的小路，西边有一座小石桥横跨在一条\n"
"山涧上，往东不远处似乎是林子的出口，一条破旧的栈道沿著山壁通往\n"
"山上，你发现地上有一些湿漉漉的脚印(footprints)，但是因为脚印太\n"
"多，分不出是往哪里去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/waterfall long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在瀑布前的一个小水潭里，水潭大约深可及胸，淹不死\n"
"人，一条白练般的瀑布(waterfall)从数百丈高的悬崖上冲激而下，溅\n"
"得你全身湿透，水潭三面都被高耸的山壁(cliff)所包围，只有南面沿\n"
"著一条山涧可以出去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/lake long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一个深不见底的水潭边上，从潭底不时有气泡冒上来\n"
"，散发著一股诡异的香味，水潭边长满了黄色叶子的怪草，四周陡峭的\n"
"山壁近乎直立，抬头只见一个半圆形的天空，唯一的出路大概只有往北\n"
"山泉流入水潭的缺口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/riverbank1 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一条山涧中的岩石上，几股泉水正从你脚边流过，水\n"
"花溅得四处飞散，南边是一个深不见底的水潭(lake)，两边的山壁看起\n"
"来又高又陡，看来要爬上岸边实在很不容易，你的北方有一座小石桥高\n"
"高地跨过两边的山壁，可是桥的高度太高，即使是轻功绝顶的高手也跃\n"
"不上去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/riverbank2 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一条山涧中的岩石上，一座小石桥正高高地从你的头\n"
"顶横跨过山涧两边的石壁(cliff)，一个瀑布就在你的北方不远处，从一\n"
"处更高的悬崖上垂了下来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/pine1 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/pine2 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/pine3 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/pine4 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/pine5 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/pine6 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/pine7 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一个松树林里，嗯....这是一个松树林....你所知就\n"
"这么多，茂密的松树遮蔽了整个天空，使你连方向都弄不清楚，最好在\n"
"天黑之前赶紧找道路径出去吧。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/cliffdown long
#. es2:d/oldpine/cliffside long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一个松树林间的小空地上，你的北边、东边、南边都\n"
"是茂密的松树，唯独西边是个悬崖(cliff)，当你探头一看，立刻不由\n"
"自主地倒抽一口凉气，在这里可得千万小心，一不小心跌了下去肯定是\n"
"粉身碎骨。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/cliff1 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/cliff2 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正栖身在一个山壁上勉强足以容纳一个人休息的岩穴中，从\n"
"这里无论是要往上爬或往下爬都有一段不算短的距离，最好先歇一歇，\n"
"喘口气再走。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/tree1 long
#. oldpine.tree.landmark.tree1_descent long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"你现在正攀附在一株大松树的树干上，从这里可以很清楚地望见树\n"
"下的一切动静，而不被人发觉，似乎是个干偷鸡摸狗勾当的好地方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/tree2 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正攀附在一株大松树的树干上，这里离地面已经有七、八丈\n"
"高，如果不小心跌了下去，不断条腿也得去半条命，松树上结了许多球\n"
"果，不过大部分都离树干很远，你构不到。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/tree3 short
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid "大松树顶"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/tree3 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"哇....你终于爬上这株松树的树顶了，一阵阵凉风从四面八方吹来\n"
"，使你觉得心旷神怡，虽然你的经验告诉你在这种地方往下看是十分不\n"
"智的，但是你还是忍不住看了一眼，这里离地面至少也有十五、六丈高\n"
"，一阵晕眩警告你最好在跌下去以前离开这个地方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/passage long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一个岩石的通道之中，在你南边有一片亮晶晶的帘幕\n"
"(curtain)，从帘幕后面传来阵阵轰隆隆的水声，通道两边的石壁上安置\n"
"著许多铜铸的烛台，照亮了这个岩穴，往北似乎有亮光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/path3 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"    你现在正站在一个阴森森的山洞之中, 一条昂首吐信的金银花蛇,\n"
"爬伏在一块突出的大青石(stone)上, 令人望而生畏, 也许你该回头逃跑了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/stone long
#. oldpine.stone.landmark.climb_down long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一块突出的大青石上, 虽然有点滑, 你还是能站稳,\n"
"往四周看, 除了长满了青苔的石壁, 好象无路可走了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/secrectpath1 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一个岩石通道之中，从南边隐隐传来哗哗的水声，岩\n"
"壁上生著厚厚的青苔，一股恶臭从北边传来，像是什么野兽，也许你该\n"
"回头出去了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/cave1 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/cave2 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/cave3 long
#. es2:d/oldpine/cave4 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在已经到达山洞的深处了, 四面八方都是些黑漆漆的小石洞,\n"
"简直不知道该往那里走, 要不是北面还有一点光线, 你都要彻底绝望了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/cave5 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在已经到达山洞的深处了, 耶...东面就是洞口了, 还可以听\n"
"见外面瀑布的水声, 仔细的观察石壁(wall), 可以发现上面有一些用利\n"
"剑雕刻的字....\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/keep1 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里只见一个木头搭成的大门，门框上挂著四、五的不知道是什么\n"
"动物的头骨跟一些铁链，外面再铺上一层乾枯的松枝，在这样一个森林\n"
"里还真不容易发觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/keep2 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里应该是老松寨了，虽然围绕著你的墙都是木头搭成的，但是仔\n"
"细一看，在许多险要的位置都放了不少沙包石堆，后面显然是埋伏人手\n"
"的好地方，如果有人贸然从大门口攻进来，肯定会吃大亏的，大寨的门\n"
"在你的西边，东边越过一排木桩之后就是大厅。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/oldpine/keep3 long
#: data/oldpine/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里就是老松寨的大厅了，靠北边的地面上铺了一张巨大的熊皮，\n"
"上面摆了三张椅子，大厅四周散落著几个取暖用的火盆，几个上了锁的\n"
"木箱子，比较奇特的是中央掘了一个大坑(pool)，坑里是许多头骨浸在\n"
"一种发著恶臭的黄水之中。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.waterfall.water name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "瀑布清水"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.lake.water name
#. village.lake.dive name
#: data/oldpine/world.json data/village/world.json
msgid "湖水"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.river.water name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "泉水"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.keep.gate name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "大门"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.pine.thicket name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "灌木丛"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.keep2.gate_trap messages.shout
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你听到你身后有几个声音大叫：把门关上！把门关上！一个也不许让他们溜走！"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.keep2.gate_trap messages.shut
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "接著「轰」地一声，通往外面的大门已经被一块大石堵死了。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.keep2.gate_trap messages.open
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你听到一阵轧轧的轮盘绞动声，堵住门口的大石慢慢地被移开了。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.ancient_pine action
#. choyin.guyehill.landmark.tree action
#: data/oldpine/world.json data/choyin/world.json
msgid "爬树"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.ancient_pine long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"一株又高又大的松树，当你抬头往上看的时候似乎有个人影\n"
"在树梢之间移动，不过也许是风吹动所造成的错觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.ancient_pine messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你手脚并用，敏捷地爬上了空地中央的大松树。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.tree.landmark.tree1_descent action
#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_down action
#. oldpine.stone.landmark.climb_down action
#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.cliffdown_cliff action
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.down action
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "往下爬"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.tree.landmark.tree1_descent messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你顺著粗大的树干，慢慢地爬了下来。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine action
#. choyin.guyehill.landmark.vine action
#: data/oldpine/world.json data/choyin/world.json
msgid "抓住藤蔓"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"其中有一根藤蔓距离你比较近，你可以试著抓住(hold)藤蔓，看看\n"
"能不能像泰山一样荡过去，看看瀑布后面有什么？\n"
"对了，提醒你一点，这座石桥下面是高约百丈的山涧深谷....。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine messages.hold
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你爬上石桥的护栏，伸手往不远处的一根藤蔓抓去...."
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine messages.fall
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "只听见一声杀猪般的惨叫，你已经往山涧中坠了下去。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine messages.fall_observer
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你听到有人高声惊叫，一条人影从上方掉了下来，「扑通」一声跌进潭中。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine messages.climb
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你手脚俐落地攀附著藤蔓，慢慢地爬下山涧....。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_vine messages.climb_observer
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "忽然一条人影从南边的帘幕穿了出来。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.riverbank1_cliff name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "山涧石壁"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.riverbank1_cliff action
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "攀爬石壁"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.riverbank1_cliff long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"两边的山壁看起来又高又陡，看来要爬上岸边实在很不容易。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.riverbank1_cliff messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你一付不信邪的表情，开始小心翼翼地攀著石壁爬了上去。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_down name
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.down name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "向下的山壁"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_down long
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.down long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"从这个勉强容身的岩穴往下爬，还有一段不算短的距离。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_down messages.use
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.down messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你试了试脚边的岩石稳不稳，开始小心翼翼地往山涧中攀了下去。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_up name
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.up name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "向上的山壁"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_up action
#. oldpine.cave.landmark.stone action
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.up action
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "往上爬"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_up long
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.up long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"从这个勉强容身的岩穴往上爬，还有一段不算短的距离。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cliff.landmark.cliff1_up messages.use
#. oldpine.cliff2.landmark.up messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你试了试脚边的岩石稳不稳，开始小心翼翼地往上攀爬。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cave.landmark.stone name
#. oldpine.stone.landmark.climb_down name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "大青石"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cave.landmark.stone long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"一块比人还高的钟乳石, 虽然长满了青苔, 但爬(climb)上去\n"
"应该不会太困难。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cave.landmark.stone messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你慢慢地攀上大青石。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.stone.landmark.climb_down messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你迅速地爬下大青石。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "石壁"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall action
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "埋葬骸骨"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"老夫南危水, 乃是昔年水烟阁五长老中第一高手,\n"
"一生醉心武学, 集天邪、封山两派之所长, 为营救盟主遭小人暗算,\n"
"埋骨于此。男子汉大丈夫死不足惜, 只可恨一身武学尚无传人!\n"
"葬(bury)我遗骨者老夫将赠以过招要旨, 唉......\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall messages.bury
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你小心翼翼地埋好了那具骸骨。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall messages.book
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你听见山洞顶部的石壁「喀喇」地一声响，一本书坠落下来。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall messages.paper
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你只看见山洞顶部纷纷扬扬飘下几张纸片来。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.caves.landmark.wall messages.fall
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你听得「轰」的一声响，已经从这摔了下去"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.cliffdown_cliff long
#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.cliffside_cliff long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"你定下心神一看，其实这个悬崖没有想像中那么恐怖，也许还\n"
"可以从这里爬下山涧，只是这世界上大概没有这种白痴愿意干\n"
"这种傻事吧。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.cliffdown_cliff messages.use
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你一付认真的表情，开始小心翼翼地攀著石壁爬了上去。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.clearing_sign long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"「官府告示：此处常有歹人出没。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.clearing_waypost name
#. green.eight0.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight1.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight2.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight3.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight4.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight5.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight6.landmark.sign name
#. green.eight7.landmark.sign name
#: data/oldpine/world.json data/green/world.json
msgid "路牌"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.clearing_waypost long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"一块旧木牌，刻着三行字：\n"
"「往西，雪亭镇。」\n"
"「往东，小石桥。」\n"
"「往南，下坡道。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.pine_knife_marks name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "刀痕"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.pine_knife_marks action
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "顺着刀痕找"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.pine_knife_marks long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"这几株松树的树干上都有刀划的记号，一道一道，深浅不一，像是有人怕走错了路，沿途留下的。记号一路往东，到那丛灌木跟前就断了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.pine_knife_marks messages.found
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "你顺着树上的刀痕往东找去，拨开那丛灌木，后面果然有一条踩得结实的小径，通往林子深处。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.pine_knife_marks messages.again
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "刀痕指的就是灌木后面那条小径。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath3_footprints name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "脚印"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath3_footprints long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"一些杂乱的脚印，不但有人的脚印，看起来还有不少马蹄印。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_waterfall name
#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.waterfall_fall name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "瀑布"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.outdoor.landmark.epath2_waterfall long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"这个瀑布从数百丈高的山壁上冲激而下，流入一个山涧底的小水潭\n"
"，水潭两边的石壁垂下许多的藤蔓(vine)，你注意到瀑布后面似乎\n"
"有什么东西在发著光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.waterfall_fall long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"这个瀑布水势并不是很大，但是高度却极高，水珠溅在你的脸上\n"
"打得隐隐生疼。你注意到瀑布后面似乎有什么东西在发著光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.waterfall_cliff name
#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.riverbank2_cliff name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "山壁"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.waterfall_cliff long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"水潭四周的山壁都有数百丈高，想要爬上去「肯定」是休想。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.gorge.landmark.riverbank2_cliff long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"这里的山壁比北边高度稍低了点，但是对凡人而言想要爬上去仍然\n"
"还有一段差距。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cave.landmark.passage_curtain name
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid "帘幕"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.cave.landmark.passage_curtain long
#: data/oldpine/world.json
msgid ""
"这片帘幕似乎是用一种极薄的丝绸织成的，后面还传来阵阵水声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/sledge_hammer name
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid "大金槌"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/sledge_hammer long
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid ""
"一把极其沈重的大槌，要挥动这样的武器非得有过人的膂力不可。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/boots name
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid "熊皮短靴"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/steel_blade name
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid "钢刀"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/steel_blade long
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid ""
"一把沈重的钢刀，磨得又利又快，看起来相当具杀伤力。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/hand_axe name
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid "短斧"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/obj/hand_axe long
#: data/goathill/items.json
msgid ""
"这种斧头的刃长柄短，是专门用来做兵器的斧头，近战具有相当强的\n"
"杀伤力。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang name
#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry topic
#: data/goathill/npcs.json data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黄霸"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang nickname
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "日月槌"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang title
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山三寨主（代寨主）"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang long
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黄霸原是关外一个山寨的寨主，后来因为逃避官府追捕而到也羊山\n"
"避祸，他的成名武器是一对各重四十斤的大金槌，内功跟横练功夫\n"
"也都有不错的造诣。\n"
"大寨主、二寨主先后没了下落，如今野羊寨的事都是他说了算——只是每年得往北麓的道观纳供。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry topic
#: data/goathill/npcs.json data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "纳供"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "说过的话老子不说第二遍。车在山路转角，去不去随你。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.lines.emote
#. choyin.court1.drum act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json data/choyin/world.json
msgid "哼了一声。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.lines.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "你倒打听得清楚。两年前北麓来了那群黑衣黑冠的道士，一座黑砖道观说起就起，自称逆灵宫。寨里折了一半弟兄。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.lines.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "半年前大寨主霍铮、二寨主一前一后没了下落，寨子就落到老子手里。老子打不过他们——每年纳供，金帛、牲口，他们要什么给什么，换这山上还有野羊寨。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.lines.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "把酒碗往桌上一顿。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.lines.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "今年的车今天就上去了，这会儿该到了山路转角。你要去，别说是老子说的。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.纳供.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "寨里的事，外人少打听。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "黄霸脸色一沉：北麓那座黑砖道观？少打听。要问，问纳供。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.大寨主.rules.say
#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.霍铮.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "大哥在里屋。要见他，自己进去。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.大寨主.rules.say
#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.霍铮.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "没了。野羊山现在姓黄。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.大寨主.rules.say
#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.霍铮.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮？半年前让道观的人带走了。你问这个做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.huo_zheng name
#. native.npc.shitou inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shang_jue inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry topic
#: data/goathill/npcs.json data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry topic
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "就那一顶，老子又不开成衣铺。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.lines.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "从墙角的箱子里翻出一顶黑冠，往你怀里一扔。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "去年抓过一个落单的道士，衣冠都在这儿，人早喂了岩蛭。黑衣你自己有，戴上这顶冠，那群牛鼻子分不出你是谁。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "见了霍铮——要是他还活着——说一声，黄霸没忘了他。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.lines.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "眯眼看了你一会儿，从墙角的箱子里翻出一顶黑冠，往你怀里一扔。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "刘老三让你来的？去年抓过一个落单的道士，衣冠都在这儿。黑衣你自己有，戴上这顶冠，那群牛鼻子分不出你是谁。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang inquiry.黑衣.rules.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣？老子穿的是布衣。少打听。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang moods.grown.title
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山寨主"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang moods.grown.chat_msg
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黄霸把酒碗往桌上一顿：野羊山，老子说了算。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang moods.grown.chat_msg
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黄霸嘟囔道：大寨主没了。没了就没了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang moods.yielded.title
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山三寨主"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang moods.yielded.chat_msg
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黄霸给里屋送了一碗酒进去，出来时抹了把脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang moods.yielded.chat_msg
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黄霸嘟囔道：大哥回来了。好，好。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼，又低头喝酒。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫的事老子听说了。大寨主没了，寨子是老子的——你也别想拿这个压老子。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "手里的酒碗啪地掉在地上。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "大哥……大哥你还活着！"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "活着。老三，寨子你管得不错——供也纳得不错。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "扑通一声跪下了。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "大哥，寨子是你的。老子从今天起还是三寨主，你要打要杀，老子不还手。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "起来。杀你不如杀道士。——这娃娃是傅家坡的，派两个弟兄送他回家，少一根头发老子找你。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.line
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "两个寨兵领着石头出了庙门。石头回头看了你一眼，没有说话。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.emote
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "转过身来，看着你。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.say
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "兄弟，野羊寨欠你一条命。以后野羊山的路，你横着走。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_hwang calls.steps.line
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮骂骂咧咧地进了土地庙的里屋，叫黄霸拿酒来。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit long
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个眼神凶恶的土匪，脸上好几条长长的刀疤，看起来就知道不好惹。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.bandit_leader long
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这个土匪看起来相当强悍，至少你从他的动作就可以看得出来他显然\n"
"是练过武功的硬手，并不是泛泛之辈。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.npc.worm long
#. goathill.npc.fat_worm long
#. goathill.npc.big_worm long
#. goathill.npc.huge_worm long
#: data/goathill/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一条色作浅灰，带著白色斑点的水蛭模样怪虫，口中露出六对白森森\n"
"的牙齿，看起来恶心极了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/mroad1 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，凹凹凸凸的山石刺得你的脚底隐\n"
"隐生疼，山路往南不远处通往一个山腰的台地，这一带最大的镇甸就位\n"
"在台地上，东边跟西边都是陡峭的山壁，山路往北通往层层叠叠的群山\n"
"之中。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/mroad2 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，路面到处生满了及膝的杂草丛，\n"
"显示这里已经有一段时间没有车马经过了，从这里往北就是野羊山的地\n"
"界，野羊山有一座山寨，住著许多凶恶的盗匪，你最好绕道而行。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/mroad3 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，东边的路旁一个山壁的裂缝里有\n"
"一间小庙，从这里看过去黑漆漆的似乎没有人照顾，山路往北是一段陡\n"
"峭的上坡，往西南的山路就平缓得多。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/temple1 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一间小土地庙中，这座庙的南北两面都是利用了山壁\n"
"而建的，只有东面一面土墙，墙上嵌著一个小小的神龛，里面供著一尊\n"
"残破不堪的土地爷爷，庙门在你的西边。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/mroad4 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条崎岖山路的转角处，山路望东通往野羊山上，从\n"
"这里可以望见东边不远处有一个石屋立在岩壁边上，看起来像是冈哨或\n"
"什么的，北边的山壁有一个裂口(crack)，不过离地约有三到四丈， 往\n"
"南的山路是段陡峭的下坡，如果你要下山，大概就是这条路了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/mroad5 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一段狭窄的山路，往东不远处的岩壁边上有一座石屋，路旁\n"
"生满了及腰的长草，山风吹过一起一伏的有如波浪一般，南北两边有许\n"
"多大石，看起来倒是个埋伏的好地点，往西是一个山路的转角。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/slope1 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一处岩石斜坡，斜坡上到处布满乱石及杂草，东边的岩壁边\n"
"有一间石屋，往西跟往北则可以回到铺满碎石的山路。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/mroad6 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，往北是一个峡谷，通过「飞火崖\n"
"」的正下方，从这里可以看到一条五、六丈宽的石梁魏颤颤地跨过峡谷\n"
"，山路往西南转过，南边则是一片岩石斜坡。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/canyon1 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条狭长的峡谷之中，东西两边都是高不可攀的峭壁\n"
"，一根五、六丈宽的石梁正横跨在你头顶的谷口，看起来摇摇欲坠，万\n"
"一掉下来只怕当场就会被压成一个肉饼，往南就是峡谷的出口，峡谷谷\n"
"底的地面看起来像是乾涸的山涧，弯弯曲曲往北通入峡谷深处。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/canyon2 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条狭长的深谷之中，东西两面都是高不可攀的峭壁\n"
"，往南沿著谷底一条乾涸的山涧可以通往峡谷的出口，北边的峭壁从这\n"
"里斜斜向上宛如从天上掉下来倒插进地面，形势更是危峻，连天空都被\n"
"北边的峭壁遮去了七、八分。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/canyon3 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条峡谷的谷底，这里的峭壁斜度之大让你胆颤心惊\n"
"，只消有人在这里一声大喝将上面的土石震了下来，只怕立刻就得被活\n"
"埋，东边的峭壁上有一个黑漆漆的洞穴，里面似乎有什么东西蠕蠕而动\n"
"，峡谷往西南和西北两边各有狭窄的出口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/cavern1 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这个岩洞的内部似乎远比你想像得大，岩壁上有一条条的深沟彷佛\n"
"是被什么蛀虫给蛀出来的，可是有什么虫会去啃咬这又硬又厚的岩壁呢\n"
"？洞穴的出口在你的西边透著微光，东北边跟西北边各有一个洞穴，黑\n"
"暗中似乎有什么东西在蠕蠕而动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/cavern2 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正在一个黑漆漆的岩洞中摸索前进，西南边隐隐有些光亮，\n"
"想必是洞穴的出口，东边似乎有些滴水的声音，不过你得走过去才能听\n"
"得仔细，你感觉脚边有一些东西在蠕蠕而动，举脚又有些黏黏的，一阵\n"
"恶心的感觉压迫著你的胃。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/cavern3 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里一片黑漆漆，你必须全靠摸索才能不至于撞到岩壁，你听到东\n"
"边传来阵阵滴水的声音，可是伸手一摸却仍是冷冰冰、又乾又硬的岩石\n"
"，地上布满了许多又黏又稠的不知名东西，使你每一步都走得异常艰辛\n"
"。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/goathill/cavern4 long
#: data/goathill/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一处阴暗的岩洞，等你走近这个岩洞才发现原来是死路，东\n"
"北边隐隐透出几道微光，想必是洞穴的出口，地上一滩滩暗黄色的黏稠\n"
"物不知道士什么东西，闻起来竟一点味道也没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.landmark.crack name
#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry topic
#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry topic
#: data/goathill/world.json data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "裂口"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.landmark.crack long
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"北边的山壁上一道黑黝黝的裂口，离地约有三四丈，站在路上够不着。裂口边缘的岩石磨得发亮，像是常有东西从那里吊上吊下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp name
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid "油布"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp act.verb
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid "钻进车里"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp act.acts.ask
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid "油布底下是供品的箱子。钻进去，就只能跟着箱子一起被吊上裂口，中途下不来。"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp act.acts.choice
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid "钻进去"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"你掀开油布一角，缩进两只箱子中间。油布落下来，眼前一黑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"过了一会儿，车板一震，绳子绷紧了——你和箱子一起离了地，在半空里晃了半天，咚的一声落在硬地上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.tarp act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"车停在那里，油布底下空空的，绳子松着——没人拉绳，钻进去也上不去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.rope name
#. niling.winch.rope name
#. niling.cliff.landmark.rope name
#: data/goathill/world.json data/niling/world.json
msgid "绳索"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.rope act.verb
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid "攀绳上去"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.rope act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"你抓住垂下的麻绳，手脚并用地攀上裂口。岩壁磨得发亮，上头有绞盘吱吱的响声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.rope act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"你戴着黑冠，押车的道士只当你是宫里的人，没人拦你。你抓住麻绳，手脚并用地攀上裂口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.rope act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"押车道士盯着你，手按在剑柄上：「此处无路，施主请回。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. goathill.mroad4.rope act.acts.steps.line
#: data/goathill/world.json
msgid ""
"裂口离地三四丈，壁上光溜溜的，没有绳子上不去。\n"
msgstr ""

