#. es2:d/temple/sroad long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一条宽敞坚实的青石大道, 大道沿著山腰往南向山下延伸, 东\n"
"边是一条石英岩石阶蜿蜒往山上而去。在石阶的尽头, 是一座颇为雄伟\n"
"的道观, 在江湖跑过的人都知道, 那是茅山派的所在地。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/ladder5 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在这阶梯的起点, 纯白色宽敞的石英岩阶梯蜿蜒而上, 在青\n"
"翠的山色中形成一条纯白色的巨龙。抬头仰望石阶尽头的那座庙宇, 虽\n"
"然无情的岁月已经在它身上留下痕迹, 但仍不失其庄严神圣的气息。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/ladder4 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正走在一道长长的石英岩阶梯上, 阶梯的两侧种植著一排高耸\n"
"的松树。雪亭镇就在西边不远的山下, 你隐约还能听到从镇上传来的\n"
"话语声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/ladder3 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正走在一道长长的石英岩阶梯上, 阶梯的两侧种植著一排高耸\n"
"的松树。雪亭镇就在西边不远的山下, 你隐约还能听到从镇上传来的\n"
"话语声。阶梯从这里弯向北边。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/ladder2 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正走在一道长长的石英岩阶梯上, 阶梯的两侧种植著一排高耸\n"
"的松树。抬头望望东北边那座高耸挺拔的山峰, 在云雾飘渺的山顶上\n"
", 矗立著一座雄伟的白色楼阁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/ladder1 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"长长的阶梯也终将到了尽头, 阶梯的尽头矗立著一座山门, 山门\n"
"上龙飞凤舞地写了三个字, 笔力苍劲有力显得气势非凡。山风吹来带\n"
"著丝丝的寒意, 令你有股高处不胜寒的感觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/entrance long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"在你眼前是一座古色古香的山门, 上面以龙飞凤舞的笔迹书写著\n"
"「灵心观」三字, 据说是当年太阳神君「杞庸」亲笔所题。往北方看\n"
"过去是一个颇大的广场。门前则是一条石英岩铺设的阶梯沿著山腰往\n"
"东而下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/square long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在灵心观前的广场前, 一片用石英岩铺成的广场。一对雄\n"
"伟的石狮子站在庙门的两侧, 狮子的两侧立著两根雕著龙纹的石柱。\n"
"广场的中央还有一个大香炉, 香炉里正冒著袅袅的香烟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/temple1 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在来到灵心观的大殿, 在你的眼前是一尊真武大帝的金身。\n"
"在金身的下方是一张朱红色的大供桌, 上面排满了鲜花素果。在桌子\n"
"的前方则摆放著三四个蒲团。东西两侧的圆形拱门通往连接后殿的回\n"
"廊。走过南边的红漆木门就是广场。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor1 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条回廊上, 西北方是一座花木扶苏的天井, 穿过\n"
"西边的圆形拱门就可以回到大殿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor2 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正走在一条回廊上, 东北方是一座花木扶苏的天井, 穿过\n"
"东边的圆形拱门就可以回到大殿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor7 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正走在一条回廊之上, 回廊往南北延伸, 两端分别连接著大殿\n"
"及后殿。西边是一座花草扶苏的天井, 东边则是一排厢房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor6 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正走在一条回廊之上, 回廊往南北延伸, 两端分别连接著大殿\n"
"及后殿。东边是一座花草扶苏的天井, 西边是一间上了锁的房间。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/inneryard long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在灵心观的天井里, 这里种植著一些花草树木, 在西北角\n"
"落里有著一口水井。北边就是供俸茅山派历代掌门人的地方, 南边则\n"
"是一面墙, 墙的另一侧就是大殿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/restroom1 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间供香客或其他江湖同道休息挂单的客房, 屋子里只是简\n"
"单地摆放著几件家俱。从西边的天井中, 传来了阵阵的花香。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor3 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在回廊转角的地方, 回廊从这往西及南边而去。在走廊\n"
"的东侧是一排厢房。北方是一条铺著青石板的小径。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor5 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在走在围绕著天井的回廊上, 回廊往东西两侧延伸, 南边就\n"
"是天井, 你也许可以走过去赏赏花, 散散心。在你的北方, 走过那扇\n"
"红漆木门就是后殿, 也是茅山派供奉历代掌门人灵位的地方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/corridor4 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在回廊转角的地方, 回廊从这往东边及南边而去。在北边\n"
"是一间大房子, 里面传来阵阵叱喝的声音。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/restroom2 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一间供香客或其他江湖同道休息挂单的客房, 屋子里只是简\n"
"单地摆放著几件家俱。你闻到天井中传来淡淡的花香。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/temple2 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在灵心观的后殿, 正中央供奉著茅山派开山祖师张天师的\n"
"画像, 在画像的下方摆放著当年张天师收妖伏魔时所用的宝剑。剑的\n"
"两旁陪祀著历代掌门人的牌位。走出南边的红漆木门可以看到天井。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/trainroom long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正站在一间宽阔的大房间里, 这里是茅山派弟子打坐练功的地\n"
"方, 空气中弥漫著一股股汗臭味。四周的墙壁上画著一幅幅经脉穴道\n"
"图。靠近墙壁的地上则摆著一个个练功用的木人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/road1 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一条铺著青石板的小径, 两侧高大的松树, 偶有松针缓缓飘落。\n"
"树干上布满了青苔, 甚至还有些蔓延到石板上。南边通往回廊, 西侧\n"
"则是后殿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/road2 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"绕过了后殿, 出现在眼前的是一栋木造两层高的屋子。屋子四周\n"
"的门窗都紧紧的关著, 门口上方挂著一方蓝色琉璃匾额, 上书『藏经\n"
"楼』三个金字。门旁立著一个石碑(slab)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/book_room1 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是灵心观中收藏书籍的地方, 四周的书架上堆了满满的书。\n"
"有些书已经旧的纸张都泛黄了, 摸一摸可能就会散掉甚至变成飞灰。\n"
"你再仔细的看了看, 发现这里都只是些寻常的修道的书籍, 似乎没有\n"
"什么特别的。角落里有一座小小的木梯通往二楼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/temple/book_room2 long
#: data/temple/rooms.json
msgid ""
"上了楼来, 首先你看到一幅张天师的画像挂在对面的墙上, 画像\n"
"的下方摆著一张覆著红布的桌子, 桌上整齐地放著茅山的镇教秘籍。\n"
msgstr ""

#. temple name
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid "茅山"
msgstr ""

#. temple.square.door name
#. temple.corridor5.door name
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid "红漆木门"
msgstr ""

#. temple.road2.landmark.slab long
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid ""
"石碑上写著 : \n"
"\n"
"    非\n"
"    茅  不\n"
"    山  得\n"
"    弟  进\n"
"    子  入\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. temple.road2.wall lines
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid "一道无形的墙挡住了门口, 差点把你的鼻子给撞扁了。"
msgstr ""

#. temple.road2.wall pass_lines
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid "你推开门走了进去, 顺手把门关了起来。"
msgstr ""

#. temple.book_room1.out_door pass_lines
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid "你拉开门大步走了出去, 随手把门带上。"
msgstr ""

#. temple.road1.moss.south lines
#. temple.road1.moss.northwest lines
#: data/temple/world.json
msgid "你一脚踩在青苔上, 不小心滑了一跤, 四脚朝天地摔在地上起不来。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.servant name
#. latemoon.npc.servant2 name
#. latemoon.npc.room.servant name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "婢女"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝雨梅是晚月庄主蓝止萍的养女，由于庄主不信任男子，因此\n"
"晚月庄接待外宾的工作向来由她负责。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay family.title
#. latemoon.npc.shaowei family.title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "大弟子"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我们晚月庄是『 以舞会友，以神换技 』\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝雨梅看你一脸疑惑！笑著说：我教你跳一曲『西出阳关』好吗?\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我跳支舞给您看好不好？\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我的舞跳得不好，待会儿我请芳绫跳舞给您看，别走远喔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry topic
#. latemoon.latemoon8.dance dance.steps.name
#. latemoon.miroom.dance dance.steps.name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/latemoon/world.json
msgid "西出阳关"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry.西出阳关
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"『西出阳关』是一种幻影式舞步。可以移形换影。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "学舞"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry.学舞
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"来!我教你...『西出阳关』(dancing out)是 ..... \n"
"经过雨梅指导后你渐渐懂了! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.zauron inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.shaowei inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/latemoon/voxel/manor.json data/latemoon/voxel/secret.json
msgid "舞"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry.舞
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"我会的舞是属于「幻影式舞步」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry.芳绫
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她是个可爱的女孩。不过有点任性，听说她贪玩被关在 \n"
"禁闭室。听说她爱玩竹蜻蜓哦。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry.竹蜻蜓
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庄内有人会用竹子作成不同物品。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "沧海龙吟"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay inquiry.沧海龙吟
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"是一种失传以久的「寒谷龙舞」\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay greeting.one_of.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"雨梅对你微笑，和善的对你说：\n"
"  这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。请坐！"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay greeting.one_of.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"雨梅对你微笑，纤细的双手捧著茶，\n"
" 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。请用茶！"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.yumay greeting.one_of.steps.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是上等金轩茶!您品尝一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她看起来像个小灵精，头上梳两个小包包头。\n"
"她坐在地上，看到你看她便向你作了个鬼脸!\n"
"你想她一定是调皮才会在这受罚!\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"顽皮的芳绫向你扮个鬼脸。  *^G^* \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫走到中央，一个姿势(Pose)。哇!你没想到她跳舞时竟有此深造诣。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫说：好不好看！这可是我花好久练成的哦! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫缓缓的移动著，手上的动作变化万千，有一种说不出的美妙。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫说：你好烦哦! 快走开! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫说：你想学可以去问昭仪姐，她会的比我多。嘻! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫说：丑八怪! 不要烦我。走开啦! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她嘟著嘴。有点生气的翻过头去，不理你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin accept_object.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "谢谢!我已经告诉你秘密了呀!去找呀! "
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin accept_object.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫很开心的拿起竹蜻蜓把玩!\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin accept_object.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"满怀感激的谢谢你! 她小声的在你耳边说：\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin accept_object.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"『 庄内前厅某处藏有一宝物手镯哦!』\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin accept_object.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你可以找找看! (search bracelet) \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin accept_object.say
#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "这要送给我啊?! 怎么好意思!谢谢你。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "替跳"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin inquiry.替跳.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "走呀走呀！密室在哪边？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin inquiry.替跳.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "我都替你跳过了！还要？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin inquiry.替跳.rules.lines.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "从地上跳起来。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin inquiry.替跳.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "关着也闷死了！第二密室？带我去——蓝姐姐问起来，你替我扛着。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin inquiry.替跳.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "替什么跳？我在受罚呢。你先去问守衣人吧。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.funlin moods.going.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"芳绫踮着脚跟在你后面，一步一个花样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl title
#. latemoon.npc.room.shaoin title
#. latemoon.npc.room.shinyu title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄第三代弟子"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她看起来非常可爱。身材玲珑有致，曲线苗条。\n"
"第一眼印象，你觉的她舞蹈一定跳的不错，看她的一举一动\n"
"有一种说不出的流畅优雅！\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"昭仪以轻妙的舞步，在房内跳了起来!你看的入神。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"昭仪抬头望著那幅图画，略有所思... \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.图
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一张非常真贵的湘绣舞曲图，我也在研究中。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.沧海龙吟
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"嗯 ...为这舞曲名。似乎雨梅姊知道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry topic
#. latemoon.latemoon8.dance dance.steps.name
#. latemoon.miroom.dance dance.steps.name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/latemoon/world.json
msgid "有凤来仪"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.有凤来仪
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"嗯 ...为这舞曲名。(dancing yu-fong)很有名！ \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.西出阳关
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「幻影式舞步」步法与地点都很重要。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.芳绫
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她聪明伶俐，会跳一些自创的舞步。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "画"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.画
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"沧海龙吟是一幅湘绣舞曲图，记载一些珍贵舞步。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "寒谷龙舞"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.寒谷龙舞.rules.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "昭仪很奇怪的望著你，说道:嘻!你对舞有兴趣呀! "
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.寒谷龙舞.rules.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "只见两眼溜来溜去，一种很神秘的表情，嘟著嘴。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.寒谷龙舞.rules.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "过了一会说：好吧!偷偷跟你说，你可以查看墙上的图。(dragon-dance) "
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.寒谷龙舞.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "...."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.舞.rules.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "昭仪很高兴的看著你，说道:嘻!你对舞有兴趣呀!"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.舞.rules.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "这有一幅图画，我从那悟到好多新舞步哦! "
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.舞.rules.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "『 沧海龙吟』是一首失传以久的舞曲。传说...."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.girl inquiry.舞.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.zauron name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "昭蓉"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.zauron long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她长得十分漂亮！让你忍不住多瞧她几眼，从她身上\n"
"你闻到淡淡的香气。她很有礼貌的向你点头，优雅的\n"
"动作，轻盈的步伐，好美哦!\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.zauron inquiry.舞
#. latemoon.npc.shaowei inquiry.舞
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"我舞跳的不好!我比较喜欢静态的活动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.zauron inquiry.芳绫
#. latemoon.npc.shaowei inquiry.芳绫
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"听说她贪玩被关在禁闭室。她最爱玩竹蜻蜓了! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.zauron greeting.one_of.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "昭蓉对你微笑，和善的对你点点头。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.zauron greeting.one_of.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"昭蓉对你微笑，以纤细轻柔的声音 \n"
" 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.guest inquiry.宝衣
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "密函里写的就是它。师父要我在庄里住着，等——等有人把它拿出来。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.tguest inquiry.宝衣
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "天山派也想要它。守衣的那个女人我打不过，等着看谁打得过。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.fochin name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "曲馥琪"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.fochin long
#. latemoon.npc.upstar.shinfun long
#. latemoon.npc.upstar.huei long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她国色天香，娇丽无伦；温柔娴静，秀绝人寰。\n"
"她姿容绝美，世所罕见。从她身旁你闻道一寒谷\n"
"幽香。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.spring2 long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她是惜春的妹妹，跟姐姐从小就在晚月庄\n"
"长大。因为与双亲失散，被庄主收留。平\n"
"常帮忙庄内琐碎事务。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yushou name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "苗郁淑"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yushou long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她看起来很有活力，两眼明亮有神。给你\n"
"一种巾帼不让须眉的气势，但刚毅之中似\n"
"又隐含著女孩子有的娇柔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yushou greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"阁下! 这里是庄内后厅厢房。不方便男客进入哦! \n"
"请随手关门，并保持安静! 谢谢! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "看管人"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这个老妇人不知姓甚名谁, 她在晚月很久了, 一直看管\n"
"书房, 连庄主都对她很尊敬。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old family.title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "前辈"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry.here
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "这里是书房，有些鞭法教材存放在这儿。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry topic
#. choyin.npc.youngman inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/choyin/npcs.json
msgid "心事"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry.心事
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"实不相瞒，这杀手是我的私生女，但已误入歧途 ...\n"
"我一直舍不得亲手杀了她，你若能帮忙我会非常感谢。 \n"
"只是要以令牌为证，唉 ..."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "令牌"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry.令牌
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "就在我儿身上 ...你拿到了就给我。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry.宝衣
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣在庄里几百年了。它在，庄就在；它走了，庄里的人就得自己守了。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old accept_object.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "作为感谢，我传你一些内力。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old accept_object.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"无名老妇手抵在你的后心，头上冒出丝丝白气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old accept_object.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你感觉到一股热气传了过来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old accept_object.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "作为感谢，我给你一本寒雪鞭法密笈。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old moods.broken.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"无名老妇坐在书房里，手里的鞭子一直没举起来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.old calls.steps.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "是她。我听见前厅的声音就知道是她。我没拦住——我一直没拦住。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.killer name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "杀手"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.killer title
#. native.npc.cult_killer name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "蒙面杀手"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.killer long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是个蒙面杀手，眉眼看起来有些面熟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.killer chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.cult_killer chat_msg_combat
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙面杀手喝道：为什么杀我？\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.killer chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.cult_killer chat_msg_combat
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙面杀手叹道：你知道我心里有多痛苦吗？！\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.spring1 long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她看起来成熟中带有一些稚气。飘逸的长发\n"
"十分迷人。她是个孤儿，从小与妹妹圆春被\n"
"庄主收留，她很聪明，在第四代弟子中算是\n"
"武功很出色的一个。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄开山祖师"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她看上去三十七岁。庄里最老的仆妇说，她小时候见到的瑷伦也是这张脸。鞭子挂在腰上，手搭在鞭柄上，像搭在一个老朋友的肩上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣在我身上。决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣出了庄。你带着它，就别再回头问我。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "你把它给了西厢那个人。几百年的东西，一句话就换了主。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。我说过了。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "你接住了。再问你一句：你拿它去做什么？——斩鬼，交给别人，还是你自己也不知道。想好了告诉我。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一会儿。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "潘军禅的嘴向来快。是，衣在庄里，我守着。守了几百年——你看我多大？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣不白给。接我三鞭，站着不倒，我们再谈。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "南危水肯开口，是你的本事。是，衣在庄里，我守着。守了几百年——你看我多大？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "什么宝衣？老身只会教鞭。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "为了斩鬼"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.marks_asker
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "答瑷伦：斩鬼"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.marks_asker
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.marks_asker
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.marks_asker
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦说了冰匣"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.marks_asker
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.marks_asker
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.marks_asker
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "dance_yu_fong"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——那支舞你跳得成，我教你记住它的名字。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "开了匣，衣是你的。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日，你自己定。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——那是玄天玉女的步法，男子跳不成。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "请庄里的姑娘替你跳：筱薇在内厅，或者禁闭房里那个贪玩的芳绫。开了匣，衣是你的。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日，你自己定。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "你答过了。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.为了斩鬼.rules.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "先接我三鞭。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "交给安妮儿"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.marks_asker
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "答瑷伦：给安妮儿"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.lines.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "脸冷了下来。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "西厢那个人等了三年，等的就是你这句话。我不拦——拿得走就拿。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。你跳得成，记住它的名字。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」，男子跳不成。请筱薇或者芳绫替你跳。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.交给安妮儿.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "安妮儿？你连她在等什么都没问过，就要替她拿衣？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "不知道"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.marks_asker
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "答瑷伦：不知"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "不知道，比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——你跳得成，记住它的名字。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "开了匣再想。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry.不知道.rules.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "不知道，比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」，男子跳不成——请筱薇或者芳绫替你跳。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi apprentice.refuse_say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "拜师! 不敢当，我都老了!你去找「芷萍」好了，看她收不收你?"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "老身不收男徒!"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.blows.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.blows.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦说道：小心了，这是第一鞭..."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.blows.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.blows.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦面露微笑：好！第二鞭来了..."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.blows.fail
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.blows.fail
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦叹了口气道：看来还是不行啊..."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.blows.say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.blows.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦鼓励道：很不错，看这最后一鞭..."
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.blows.fail
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.blows.fail
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦叹了口气道：太可惜了！"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.success
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦露出慈祥的面容：看来我没看错人。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄第一代弟子"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.label
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "接她三鞭"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon trials.success
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "瑷伦收起鞭子：站得住。那就再问你一句——你拿它去做什么？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon accept_object.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "出了庄门的衣，不是晚月庄的了。拿走吧。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "接过宝衣，抖开，披在肩上。衣角落下去的时候，屋里凉了一截。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon accept_object.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "我守到决战那日。到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon moods.keeping.title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "守衣人"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon moods.keeping.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦的手搭在腰间，那里多了一层月白的衣角。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon moods.keeping.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦说：决战那日，你来叫我。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon moods.bereft.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦望着东厢的窗，很久没动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon moods.bereft.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦低声说：几百年……到我手里丢的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon calls.steps.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼，又看向你空着的手。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon calls.steps.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "衣出了庄，凤凰暗了。前厅的事你看见了——那是衣走了的价钱。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon calls.steps.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "没有看你。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.elon calls.steps.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "你把它给了西厢那个人。凤凰暗了，前厅死了人——几百年的东西，一句话就换了主。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "安妮儿"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "它在我这里。你记得这一点就够了——东方神教也记得。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣出了庄。你的名字，我记下了。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "守衣人让你过了？那她看中了你。我在西厢住了三年，等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人——衣交给我，不比交给一个几百年不出庄的人差。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "我在西厢住了三年，等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人。你是哪一个？"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi accept_object.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "出了庄的衣，不必再拿来给我看。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "接过宝衣，手指在衣料上停了一停。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi accept_object.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "月神族守了几百年，守给我的。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi accept_object.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "你配得上。东方神教记得你——这句话，以后有用。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi moods.worthy.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安妮儿把一件月白的衣叠在膝上，谁也不看。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi moods.remembers.chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安妮儿看了你一眼，像在数你的名字有几个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi calls.steps.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣出了庄，没进我的门。你的名字，我记下了。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yuchoun name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "虞琼衣"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yuchoun title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄弟子"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yuchoun greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"琼衣很礼貌的向你微笑! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.yuchoun greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"说道：请保持安静哦! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shaoin name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "龙韶吟"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shaoin hit_ob.message
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "你觉得被打中的地方一阵麻痒！"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shaoin greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"韶吟惊慌生气的怒斥： 喂! 兄台不要乱闯! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shaoin greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她的眼神骤变，隐约中似乎让人神智渐模糊! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shinyu name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "阮欣郁"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shinyu greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"欣郁大喊： 喂! 兄台! 这不准男人进来! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shinyu greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"欣郁从袖里取出一把粉红色细粉泼撒出去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.shinyu greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"欣郁一脚往闯入者踢了出去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.fireangel name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "凤凰"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.fireangel title
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "护庄神像"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.fireangel long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"火神「凤凰」乃勇士寒于的魂魄所化成的十三个精灵之一。\n"
"由于其奇异神迹，被晚月庄供奉为护庄神兽。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.fireangel greeting.rules.steps.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"神像眼神骤变，幻化成七彩凤凰，出现金色光芒。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.eton name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "金仪彤"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.room.eton long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她国色天香，娇丽无伦；温柔娴静，秀绝人寰。\n"
"可惜眉心上有一道地煞纹干犯紫斗，恐要玉手\n"
"染血，浩劫武林。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"她长得十分漂亮！让你忍不住多瞧她几眼，从她身上\n"
"你闻到淡淡的香气。她很有礼貌的向你点头，优雅的\n"
"动作，轻盈的步伐，好美哦!\n"
"她是晚月庄主蓝止萍的养女。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei inquiry.竹蜻蜓
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"咦..!你也喜欢玩啊! 我会做哦! \n"
"不过我需要一根竹子! 你找来我帮你做! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei greeting.one_of.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "筱薇对你微笑，和善的对你点点头。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei greeting.one_of.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"筱薇对你微笑，以纤细轻柔的声音 \n"
" 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.lines.say
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "我已经帮你做一个竹蜻蜓了呀! "
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.make.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"筱薇微笑的看著你说：你要作竹蜻蜓呀!\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.make.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"筱薇将你给她的竹子仔细的看了一下。说道：不错是根玉竹! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.make.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"筱薇将竹子周围的叶子弄掉，灵巧的削凿著。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.make.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"经过不久，筱薇把竹蜻蜓做好了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.shaowei accept_object.make.lines.line
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"筱薇将做好的竹蜻蜓递给你，微笑说道：嗯! 做好了! \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl name
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "采花少女"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl long
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女是绮云镇居民的小孩，从小就到晚月庄来摘桂花，蓝止\n"
"萍很喜欢她们，也教给她们了些基本的武功，时间久了，这些少\n"
"女的功夫还都不错。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"顽皮的采花少女向你扮个鬼脸。  *^G^* \n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女说道：华中理工大学的桂花树比晚月庄多多了，你知道吗？\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女望着天边的晚霞，双手托着香腮，说道：我好想去华工大摘桂花。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女嘀咕着：听说华工的桂花有好几种呢。\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg_combat
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女秀眉微蹙，说道：你欺负我年纪小是吗？\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg_combat
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女说道：你要是再无理取闹，让火玫瑰毒死你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl chat_msg_combat
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid ""
"采花少女骂道：你这无赖，别死缠着我！\n"
msgstr ""

#. latemoon.npc.park.flwgirl inquiry topic
#. village.npc.fisher inquiry topic
#: data/latemoon/npcs.json data/village/npcs.json
msgid "桂花"
msgstr ""

