msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2 long
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid ""
"小娟姓刘，是这里刘老农的独生女。今年十六岁，人长的漂靓又大方。\n"
"小娟已经被折磨的遍体鳞伤。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2 chat_msg_combat
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid ""
"小娟说道：唉！ 没料道你和那些坏人是一伙的！\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2 calls.steps.say
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid "救我！救救我呀！"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2 calls.steps.emote
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid "竭力挣扎，渐渐从绳索里摆脱出来……。"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.xiaojuan2 attack_ask
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid "小娟遍体鳞伤，只剩一口气，这一击会要了她的命。确定要攻击她吗？"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.guard2 name
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.npc.guard2 long
#: data/chuenyu/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是黑松堡的狱卒\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/croad1 long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正走在一条黄土大道上。路上尘土飞扬，路旁稀疏几棵矮树。\n"
"往南通往京师，东北是通往天驼关的大道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/croad2 long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是个交叉路口，过往行人很多。路边有一个茶馆，是供行\n"
"人歇息的地方。向南是通往京师的北驿道，北方可见阴森的黑松山。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/sunnyroad long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你的两侧是茂盛的稻田，还有一条清澈见底的小溪。许多乡民在田里\n"
"辛苦的忙碌着。再北面是黑松山。眺望山顶，你似乎可以看到一个颇具规\n"
"模的城堡。城堡的最顶端插着一面大旗，大旗上绣着两个斗大的金字：淳于。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/base_b_m long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一座高而险的山峰耸立在你面前。北面是一条上山的羊肠小路，盘旋曲折。\n"
"黑湮湮的松林给你不祥的感觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/foot_b_mtn long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你正在艰难的走在唯一通往山顶的小路上。路边堆着很多面目\n"
"狰狞的巨石。几棵幼松顽强的从石缝中挤了出来。你在这\n"
"里可以看到山顶城堡的大致伦廓。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/high_b_mtn long
#. es2:d/chuenyu/high_b_mtn2 long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是通往城堡的石街，整条石街全是用巨大的花岗岩砌成的。\n"
"单这条石路就足已表明城堡主人的富有和气势。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/rope_bridge long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"山顶强劲的风吹得铁索桥左右晃动，脚下的万丈深渊使你头晕目旋。\n"
"你竭尽全力的维持身体平衡。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/gate_castle long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站立在一座宏伟的城堡之前，城门(door)之上挂着一块金匾。金匾上\n"
"龙飞凤舞的写着四个大字“黑松淳于”，金匾左下角刚劲草书落款：\n"
"“淳于怀太”，“壬子年一月十八日”。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/east_castle long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站在黑松山顶，黑松城堡的东侧。高耸的城墙上长满了青色的\n"
"蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。再往东是刀削般的万丈悬崖。\n"
"往西则是城堡的正门。你脚下是一块青石板。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/west_castle long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站在黑松山顶，黑松城堡的西侧。高耸的城墙上长满了青色的\n"
"蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。再往西是刀削般的万丈悬崖。\n"
"往东则是城堡的正门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/trap_castle long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在处于一个窄窄的夹道里，通向北面的路被一块巨石(rock)堵死。\n"
"夹道的两侧是三丈高的石墙(wall)。出乎你的意料，石墙上布满了\n"
"碗大的圆孔(hole)。石墙的后面传出“吱吱嘎嘎”的声音(noise)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/west_garden long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站在黑松城堡的西花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n"
"西侧高耸的城墙上长满了青色的蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。\n"
"再往东则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/north_garden long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站在黑松城堡的北花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n"
"再通向北面的路被一块巨石(rock)堵死。再往南则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/west_blackge long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是黑松堡主淳于怀太迎宾的西厅。整个大厅布置的雍荣典雅。\n"
"向东是黑松阁的正厅，向西和向北都是精心修剪过的花园。楼上则是\n"
"淳于巨大的睡房。南面是一个小小的储藏室。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/storage long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一个小小的储藏室。四壁上布满了灰尘。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/center long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"黑松阁正厅完全是用檀香木打造的。一阵阵的檀香飘过来，\n"
"使你心旷神夷。厅口悬着一幅字画，写道：“是非成败转头空，\n"
"青山依旧在，几度夕阳红。”整幅字画是用一条很粗的绳子挂起\n"
"来的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/east_blackge long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是黑松堡主淳于怀太迎宾的东厅。整个大厅布置的雍荣典雅。\n"
"向东和向西都是精心修剪过的花园。楼上则是淳于巨大的睡房。\n"
"偶尔有几声狗叫从东花园里传来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/east_garden long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站在黑松城堡的东花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n"
"东侧高耸的城墙上长满了青色的蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。\n"
"再往西则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/south_garden long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你站在黑松城堡的南花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n"
"再往北则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/bedroom long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是淳于堡主起居的地方。东面的楼梯向下通向黑松阁东厅，\n"
"西面的楼梯向下通向黑松阁西厅。北面是一个小小的阳台。南面则\n"
"是堡主的膳房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/yiantai long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是一个小小的阳台。从这里你可以一直望到山脚。强劲\n"
"的山风吹在你身上，让你感到份外的凉爽。真是一个好去处。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/kitchen long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这是淳于堡主的用膳房。整个房间飘荡着上等竹叶青的酒香和\n"
"令人垂滟欲滴的烤山猪的香气。你似乎听到你的肚子在“咕咕咕”\n"
"的叫了起来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/tunnel1 long
#. es2:d/chuenyu/tunnel2 long
#. es2:d/chuenyu/tunnel3 long
#. es2:d/chuenyu/tunnel5 long
#. es2:d/chuenyu/tunnel6 long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里黑黑暗暗，几乎伸手不见五指。唯一的光亮来自墙上忽明忽暗的\n"
"松油灯。地上和墙上布满了暗红色的血痕，散发出阵阵腥气。不断传来的\n"
"哀嚎声在死沉的地牢里回荡，令人毛骨耸然。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/tunnel4 long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里黑黑暗暗，几乎伸手不见五指。唯一的光亮来自墙上忽明忽暗的\n"
"松油灯。地上和墙上布满了暗红色的血痕，散发出阵阵腥气。不断传来的\n"
"哀嚎声在死沉的地牢里回荡，令人毛骨耸然。地牢的天花板上镶着一块石\n"
"板，从石板的缝隙间射进几束阳光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/dungeon long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你处在一个阴湿的地牢里。地牢的角落里堆着一些干草，干草上沾满了\n"
"暗红色的血迹。许多骷髅被生锈的铁链绑在墙上。偶尔之间，你还可以听到\n"
"老鼠“吱吱”的尖叫声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/chuenyu/tortureroom long
#. es2:d/chuenyu/tortureroom2 long
#: data/chuenyu/rooms.json
msgid ""
"整间刑房已被乾曷的血迹然成暗红色。散发着扑鼻的腥臭。墙上挂满了\n"
"各式各样的邢具。刑房的地上散落着生锈的铁链和破碎的骷髅。偶尔之间，\n"
"你还可以听到老鼠“吱吱”的尖叫声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.bedroom.door name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "玉帘门"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.high_b_mtn.killing_air lines
#. chuenyu.high_b_mtn2.killing_air lines
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "你被黑松堡散出的强烈杀气当了回来。"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.arrows act.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"刹那间石墙的后面“嘣嘣”声不绝，无数羽箭从圆孔中向你激射而出！！\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.arrows act.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你被乱箭射得头破血流，遍体鳞伤！\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.center.landmark.rope long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"这根绳子顺着墙垂下来，你似乎可以拉(pull)它，但是你有一种不祥的感觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.landmark.wall name
#. chuenyu.east_garden.landmark.wall name
#. chuenyu.west_castle.landmark.wall name
#. chuenyu.west_garden.landmark.wall name
#. chuenyu.east_castle.climb name
#. chuenyu.east_garden.climb name
#. chuenyu.west_castle.climb name
#. chuenyu.west_garden.climb name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "城墙"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.landmark.wall long
#. chuenyu.east_garden.landmark.wall long
#. chuenyu.west_castle.landmark.wall long
#. chuenyu.west_garden.landmark.wall long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"城墙虽陡，但长满了蔓藤。你似乎可以试着爬(climb)上去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.landmark.vine name
#. chuenyu.east_garden.landmark.vine name
#. chuenyu.west_castle.landmark.vine name
#. chuenyu.west_garden.landmark.vine name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "蔓藤"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.landmark.vine long
#. chuenyu.east_garden.landmark.vine long
#. chuenyu.west_castle.landmark.vine long
#. chuenyu.west_garden.landmark.vine long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"蔓藤长满了城墙，你似乎可以试着爬(climb)上去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.landmark.rock name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "青石板"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.landmark.rock long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"青石板劳牢的镶在地下，但它下面似乎是空的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.north_garden.landmark.rock name
#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.rock name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "巨石"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.north_garden.landmark.rock long
#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.rock long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"这是一块千斤巨石，阻住了通向北面的路。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.wall name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "石墙"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.wall long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"这是一道三丈高，厚达尺许的石墙。墙上的圆孔很适合用来发暗箭。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.hole name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "圆孔"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.hole long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你试着往圆孔里看，可是里面太黑了，什么也看不到。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.noise name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "声音"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.trap_castle.landmark.noise long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"这显然是拉开强弩的声音。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.rope_bridge.landmark.chain name
#. chuenyu.rope_bridge.climb name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "铁链"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.rope_bridge.landmark.chain long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"这里只有一条铁链（chain）。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.tunnel4.landmark.rock name
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "石板"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.tunnel4.landmark.rock long
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"很沉重的石板，但你似乎可以推动它。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.tunnel4.landmark.rock messages.push
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "你试著往上用力推动石板，石板变得越来越松动了...."
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.tunnel4.landmark.rock messages.open
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "石板终于被推的斜立起来，露出一个向上的缝隙。"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.tunnel4.landmark.rock messages.close
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "石板“轰”的一声又倒了下来，将向上的通道盖住了。"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.tunnel4.landmark.rock messages.close_beyond
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "石板“轰”的一声又倒了下去，将向下的通道盖住了。"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.climb act.acts.steps.line
#. chuenyu.east_garden.climb act.acts.steps.line
#. chuenyu.west_castle.climb act.acts.steps.line
#. chuenyu.west_garden.climb act.acts.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你抓着蔓藤，慢慢的顺着城墙爬了上去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.east_castle.climb act.acts.steps.line
#. chuenyu.east_garden.climb act.acts.steps.line
#. chuenyu.west_castle.climb act.acts.steps.line
#. chuenyu.west_garden.climb act.acts.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你用手一撑墙头儿，轻巧的跳了过来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.rope_bridge.climb act.verb
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "顺着走下去"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.rope_bridge.climb act.acts.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你抓紧铁链，顺着铁索桥走了下去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.center.pull act.verb
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "拉"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.center.pull act.acts.ask
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "这根绳子连着翻板：一拉就会掉进下面的地牢，摔得不轻，也没法顺着绳子爬回来。确定要拉绳子吗？"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.center.pull act.acts.choice
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid "拉绳子"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.center.pull act.acts.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你试着拉了一下绳子，触动了翻板，整个人“轰隆”一声掉了下去！\n"
msgstr ""

#. chuenyu.center.pull act.acts.steps.line
#: data/chuenyu/world.json
msgid ""
"你“轰隆”一声，从上面掉了下来！摔得你好痛！\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.hell_guard long
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个负责看守鬼门关的阴卒，他们是鬼卒中的精锐，负责阻挡想要\n"
"侵入酆都城的妖魔鬼怪。\n"
msgstr ""

