msgstr ""

#. death.npc.hell_guard attack_ask
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "阴鬼牙将是守关鬼卒里的精锐，你现在只是一缕鬼魂，打输了会再死一次，再受一次死亡的惩罚。确定要攻击他吗？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle name
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle long
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白无常伸著长长的舌头瞪著你，死白的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白无常把长长的舌头伸出来，缓缓地舔了舔自己又白又长的手指。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常用奇异的眼光盯著你，好像要看穿你的一切似的。"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常「哼」的一声，从袖中掏出一本像帐册的东西翻看著。"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常阁上册子，说道：咦？阳寿未尽？怎么可能？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常搔了搔头，叹道：罢了罢了，你走吧。"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle long
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑无常伸著长长的舌头瞪著你，黝黑的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑无常把长长的舌头伸出来，缓缓地舔了舔自己又黑又长的手指。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle calls.steps.say
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "喂！阳人来阴间做什么？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "黑无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "黑无常用奇异的眼光盯著你，好像要看穿你的一切似的。"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/bridge1 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一条漫长的石桥，往南石桥延伸进大雾之中，望不到尽头，\n"
"往北引隐约约有一座城楼，不过你分不清是真实的影像还是幻觉，东西\n"
"两面都是一望无际的大雾，一阵阵阴冷的微风从雾中吹过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/bridge long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一条极长的石桥上，桥头一块石碑上面刻著「奈何桥\n"
"」三个古篆，东、西两面都是大雾，连桥底下是不是水都看不到，浓雾\n"
"中有许多朦胧的人影鱼贯地向北走去，奈何桥往南延伸到一片大雾之中\n"
"，北边引隐约约有一座城楼的影子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/gate long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里就是著名的阴间入口「鬼门关」，在你面前矗立著一座高大的\n"
"黑色城楼，许多亡魂正哭哭啼啼地列队前进，因为一进鬼门关就无法再\n"
"回阳间了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/gateway long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在来到一座黑色城楼之前，城楼上刻著三个大字：酆都城。往\n"
"南不远处有一座桥，桥上鬼影幢幢，但是却听不到半点声音，往北走进\n"
"城楼只见一片黑漆漆的，只有少许暗红色的火光若隐若现地闪烁著。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/road1 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你走在一条阴森森的路上, 浓浓的雾环绕在你的四周, 好像永\n"
"远都不会散去似的. 往南看去你勉强可以分辨出一个城楼的模样,\n"
"往北隐约可以看到几盏灯笼, 在浓雾中显得格外的诡异. 路的两旁\n"
"各有一栋木造的建筑, 门都是半开的, 但你看不清楚里面有什么.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/inn1 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你一进来就发现屋里异常的温暖, 墙角壁炉里微弱的火光将你\n"
"的影子投射在对面的墙上. 几个人影(shadows)围在炉旁不知在讨\n"
"论些什么. 屋内有几张木桌, 椅, 墙上挂了几幅字画, 一切看来非\n"
"常的详和宁静, 你几乎忘了自己身在何处.\n"
" \n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/inn2 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"屋里相当冷清, 外面的浓雾还不时地从半开著的门缝飘进来,\n"
"地面上散著一些破旧的物品, 不过光从外表已经无法分辨出那是些\n"
"什么东西了. 墙上(wall)刻著一些潦草的字体, 墙角的一盏灯笼挣\n"
"扎似地发出一阵阵微弱的光芒, 也始得那些字看来格外的诡异.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/road2 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你走在一条阴森森的路上, 浓浓的雾环绕在你的四周, 好像永\n"
"远都不会散去似的. 整条路前后只看到零星的几盏灯笼........\n"
" \n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/road3 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"浓雾在这里聚成一堵墙，路到这里就断了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death name
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "阴间"
msgstr ""

#. death.gateway.no_return lines
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "一个空洞的声音在你耳边响起...."
msgstr ""

#. death.gateway.no_return lines
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "没有回头路了!"
msgstr ""

#. death.road2.long_road lines
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "你走著走著..... 发现四周景色居然都没有变...."
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.landmark.shadows name
#. death.inn1.ask_home name
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "人影"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.landmark.shadows long
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"从你站的位置很难辨别出那几个人的容貌, 四个披著黑斗蓬的人斜靠在壁\n"
"炉边的角落, 偶尔传来其中几人说话的声音, 不过从这个距离你无法听到\n"
"他们讨论的内容. 当你还在考虑要不要靠过去一点时, 其中一人回头看了\n"
"你一眼, 你愣住了... 那人... 那人......... 居然长得跟你一模一样!\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn2.landmark.wall long
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"几行你勉强分辨得出来的字:\n"
"我被困在这里了.... 我要回家啦!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"                      ^^^^\n"
"                        靠自己啦...\n"
"什么叫靠自己啊?!?!? 这里连个活人都没有...\n"
"\n"
"看到你自己时问一下吧... 自己人都会互相帮忙的说.. \n"
"                                    ^^^^\n"
"                                 你... 确... 定?!?!\n"
"喔.. \n"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.ask_home act.verb
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "打听「回家」"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.ask_home act.acts.steps.line
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"你走上前去, 低声的向那个长得跟你一样的人询问回家的事.\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.ask_home act.acts.steps.line
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"那人一句话也不说就往你这边撞过来, 你眼前一阵黑....\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/black_crown name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "黑冠"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/black_crown long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一顶黑绢裹的道冠，冠前镶一枚乌黑的铁片，铁片上錾着一个看不懂的字。逆灵宫的道士人人戴它——戴上它，他们也把你当自己人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger name
#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#: data/niling/items.json data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "账册"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一本黑皮的账册，封皮上没有字。翻开是一笔笔纳供的账：金帛、腌肉、麻绳……每一页的末尾另起一行，记的不是东西。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"你翻到最后几页。每一页末尾另起的那一行，记的是人：\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"「野羊寨，三名，丁未年秋，入丹房。」\n"
"「关北民夫，七名，戊申年冬，三名入丹房，四名留用。」\n"
"「傅家坡，孩童一名，七岁，戊申年腊月，留用，待子时。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"纳供的不只是金帛。你把账册合上，手心全是汗。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一叠公文纸，每张末尾盖着一方朱红的大印，印文是「兵部之印」。纸是新的，印泥还没干透。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"文书的格式一板一眼，字是衙门里的楷书：\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"「着逆灵宫代为收管关北河工逃役若干名，解送之日另行知照。」\n"
"「着逆灵宫代为收管野羊山匪徒若干名，毋庸解京。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"每一张的印都盖得端端正正。兵部的印，怎么会盖在一座黑道观的账上？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_key name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "地牢钥匙"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_key long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一把乌黑的铁钥匙，齿很深，柄上系着一截黑布。地牢三扇铁栅门用的都是它。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/scroll_fragment name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "逆灵天书残卷"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/scroll_fragment long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"半卷黑皮的经书，封皮上「逆灵天书」四个字只剩下三个。里面的字横着竖着走，看一眼就头晕。这是玄冥子的——他说过，要练六阴剑，拿着它来后山找他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_huo name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "霍铮的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_huo long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"霍铮的尸首。铁链还在手腕上，拳头攥着，指缝里有血——不是他的。他到最后也没求饶。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_shitou name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "石头的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_shitou long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一个小孩子的尸首，头上两个小抓揪。他蜷在墙角，手里还攥着一颗小石子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，两手把着绞盘的摇柄，肩膀一耸一耸。他看了你一眼，又低头去摇，像是什么也没看见——能上到这里来的，在他眼里都是宫里放上来的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士咬着牙摇了一圈绞盘，绳子吱吱地响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士嘟囔道：今年的供比去年沉……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士朝裂口里喊了一声：下面的，拴好了没有！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士头也不抬：供在那边堆着，管事叫你搬就搬。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士道：宫里的事，问管事去，别问我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士摇绳的手顿了一顿：不认识。……你问这个做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.裂口
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士道：底下是野羊山的山路。宫里的人不走山路，只走这根绳。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士松了绞盘，尖声道：来人哪！有生人上来了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在门房的桌后，面前摊着一本簿子，手里的笔却半天不动。他的眼睛不看簿子，看门洞——谁进来，他先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "抬眼看了看你头上的黑冠，又低下头去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "新来的？进去别乱走。后殿不许去，地牢不许去，管事叫你干什么就干什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士道：这里就是。进了这道门，就别再问这个名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士道：野羊寨的供今天到。东边货栈，搬完了再说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士的笔停了一下：没这个人。……谁让你问的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.后殿
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士道：后殿是宫主行法的地方。没有大弟子的话，谁都不许进。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"门房道士厉声道：哪里来的野人，敢闯逆灵宫！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"门房道士朝院里喊：有生人！拦住他！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "守门道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，背着手站在院子里，腰上一柄短剑。他站得笔直，眼睛半闭着，像在听什么——听见生人的脚步，眼睛就睁开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士把腰上的短剑往上提了提。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士低声念了一句什么，声音像蚊子哼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "守门道士道：少说话，多干活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "守门道士朝东边一偏头：货栈。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士喝道：生人闯宫，留下！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士一剑劈空，剑风带起一股苦味。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽着，正把一只箱子里的绸缎一匹匹抖开来数。他数得很慢，数到一半停下来，往那几只画着符的箱子那边瞟一眼，再从头数。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士数着绸缎：……十一、十二……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士踢了踢一只画着符的箱子，箱子里没有动静，他松了口气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士道：都是野羊寨的供。你是哪一房的？管事让你来搬？搬那边的，画着符的别碰。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.箱子
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士压低声音：画符的那几只，是「祭」。等子时，大弟子来取。你没见过，我也没说过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士道：干活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士道：野羊寨的大寨主？半年前就进了地牢，还问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士叫道：有贼！有贼偷供！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士一边招架一边往门口退。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，跪在蒲团上，两手按着膝盖，嘴唇一开一合。他诵经的声音又低又快，像是怕慢一个字就要挨罚。他的眼睛是闭着的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士低声念道：……灵不灵，逆之则生……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士的声音忽然高了一下，又压了下去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士跪得久了，膝盖动了动，领诵的木鱼声一停，他立刻又跪直了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士闭着眼睛：诵经的时候不说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "经"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.经
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士压低声音：逆灵天书。你连这个都不知道？……不要问我，问领诵。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士的嘴唇停了一下，又接着念，像没听见。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.后殿
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士道：宫主在后殿行法。子时开坛，没你的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士尖叫道：生人！前殿有生人！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士一边念经一边拔剑，念的和砍的一样快。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的老道士，跪在最前头的蒲团上，面前一只乌黑的木鱼。他一下一下敲着，节拍一丝不乱，诵的字句比别人多一倍。进来什么人、出去什么人，他一次头也没抬过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士的木鱼声一下紧似一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士念道：……以身为供，以劫为师……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士的木鱼没停：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。这是第一句。你连第一句都要人教？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.经
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士道：逆灵天书，宫主亲授。前殿只诵前三卷，后面的，没到你的分。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士的木鱼慢了一拍：野羊寨那个？在底下。子时便用他开坛。——你是哪一房的，问这个？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.后殿
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士道：后殿是宫主的。大弟子不带，谁也不许过那道门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "宫主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.宫主
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士道：宫主姓商。别的，不是你该问的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士霍地站起，木鱼槌一指：拿下！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士喝道：殿前动手，坛上加供！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在账房的大案后面，手里一支笔，面前一本账。他的手指上全是墨，指甲缝里是黑的。他抬头看了你一眼，眼睛先落在你的冠上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管事道士拨了两下算盘，皱起眉头，又拨回去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管事道士对着账册自言自语：七个……还差三个。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：野羊寨的供今年足数。关北的车下月到。你是来领活的？货栈搬箱子去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.账册
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士把手按在账册上：账是宫主要看的，不是给你看的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "文书"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.文书
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：兵部的公文，你认得字？……认得也当不认得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：野羊寨的大寨主，账上第三笔。子时开坛。你问这个做什么？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "钥匙"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：地牢的钥匙在大弟子腰上。我这里只有账，没有钥匙。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：少废话。干活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管事道士把账册往怀里一塞，叫道：有贼！护账！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer name
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，靠着甬道的石壁站着，腰上没有钥匙，只有一柄短剑和一根鞭子。他听见脚步声就直起身来，先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士用鞭柄敲了敲铁栅：安静！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士打了个哈欠，往西边那间牢房瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：钥匙？在大弟子玄冥子腰上。开坛的时候他才下来开门。我们只看人，不开门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士朝西边一偏头：西边那间。骂了半年了，嗓子还没哑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "孩子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.孩子
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：北边那间的小的？傅家坡抓来的。宫主说小孩子的供最干净。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.民夫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：东边两个，关北挖河的。挖不动了，就送到这里来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.逆灵宫
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：底下不许多话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士抽出鞭子，吼道：地牢有生人！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng title
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山大寨主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高大的汉子，瘦得脱了形，颧骨突出来，手腕上两道铁链磨出来的血痕。头发胡子乱成一团，眼睛却亮得吓人。他被锁在牢房里，看见你，先骂了一句，再看清你的脸，骂声停了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮朝铁栅外啐了一口：臭道士！有种把老子放出去打！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮用铁链在墙上狠狠砸了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮喃喃道：黄霸……黄霸这个王八蛋……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮咬着牙道：两年前他们上山，寨子折了一半弟兄。老子带人来烧他们的观，中了埋伏——老子和老二，一个也没回去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shitou name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.石头
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮朝北边一偏头：北边那间的娃娃，傅家坡抓来的，才七岁。半年了，哭都哭不出声了。你要是能开门，先开他的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.黄霸
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮的眼睛红了：老三。老子前脚进来，他后脚纳供。纳的什么供？纳的是老子的弟兄！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮道：钥匙在那个姓玄的腰上——他们叫他大弟子。他每天子时下来一趟，挑人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "野羊寨"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.野羊寨
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮道：寨子还在吗？黄霸还在土地庙？……他要是还在，告诉他，老子没死。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮一愣：老刘？老刘没进来？好，好。他在哪？……他若肯回来，寨子还有救。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "二寨主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.二寨主
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮低声道：老二在丹房。他们说的「入丹房」，就是那个意思。别问了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮吼道：来！老子手上有链子也打得死你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "挣了挣手上的铁链——链子早让他磨断了一半，一扯就开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "好兄弟。老子跟你走。北边那间还有个娃娃，一起带上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个七岁的小孩子，头上梳着两个小抓揪，脸脏得看不出模样，衣服还是傅家坡的粗布。他缩在牢房的角落里，看见你，往墙上又缩了缩，没有哭。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"石头把墙角的几颗小石子摆了又摆。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"石头小声说：娘……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "娘"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.娘
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头抬起头：娘在傅家坡。娘说别跟人走。……我没跟人走，是他们把我装进箱子里的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "傅家坡"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.傅家坡
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头道：我家在湖边，门口有瓜地。娘每天到村口等我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.黑松山
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头摇头：不是黑松山。是黑衣服的道士，他们说是黑松山的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头小声道：他们晚上来挑人。挑走的就不回来了。那个大胡子叔叔说，轮到我他就把门撞开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头道：西边的大胡子叔叔。他骂人的时候我就不怕了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "愣了一下，爬起来抓住你的衣角。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "……带我回家。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑瘦的汉子，手掌全是老茧，肩膀上一道挑担磨出来的硬皮。他穿的是河工的短褂，上头印着一个「役」字。他靠着墙坐着，眼睛半闭，像是把力气都省着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关北民夫揉着肩膀，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关北民夫低声道：……河挖不动了，人也挖不动了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.关北
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：俺们是关北挖河的。河工挖不动的，官府说送回家，车一拐就到了这里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：这里的道士拿人当药材。俺亲眼看见的，不骗你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.文书
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：押车的说俺们是兵部批的。兵部？俺们挖河，关兵部什么事？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：西边那位是条汉子。有他骂着，俺们还敢喘气。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "俺们回关北！多谢恩公！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue name
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "商玦"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue title
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫宫主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道人，背对着你站在黑石坛前，双手拢在袖里。他的衣冠和别的道士一样，只是黑得更深，像是吸光的。他念经的声音不高，一句接一句没有停顿，像水从石缝里渗出来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "商玦没有回头：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。你既走上坛来，便是明白人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "商玦的声音没有起伏：供品。子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "后殿里没有神像。一座黑石坛立在正中，坛上一团黑焰无声地烧着，照不亮什么。商玦背对着你，念经的声音没有停。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "……以身为供，以劫为师。灵不灵，逆之则生。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "转过身来，目光在你的脸上停了一停。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "宫主，有生人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "祭品自己走上坛来，是劫的意思。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "黑焰忽然向上一窜，焰心里现出一个人形——没有头。它站在坛上，两只手朝前摸索着，像在找什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "的手摸到了坛沿，停住了。整座后殿冷得像井底。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "它在找头。找了五千年。子时开坛，带祭品上来，它便安静一夜。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "解下腰间一把乌黑的钥匙，看也不看，往后一抛。玄冥子接住了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "去，告诉底下的人：子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "黑焰里的人形散成一股黑烟，坛上又只剩一团焰。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "你戴着我们的冠，却不是我们的人。等子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "转身走向坛后的黑门。门开了，门里比殿里更黑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "子时见。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "坛底的石缝里有什么东西在爬。两个鬼卒从坛底爬了出来——灰绿的皮，手里一柄钢叉，面目狰狞。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi name
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi title
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff title
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff moods.owed.title
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫大弟子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，比别的道士高出半个头，站在坛边，腰上挂着一柄长剑和一串钥匙。他的脸上没有表情，眼睛却一直在动——看坛、看门、看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子按住腰上的钥匙串：子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子站在崖径当中，长剑已经出鞘。崖边的绳索断了，商玦不在。他挡在你和断崖之间，没有让的意思。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子冷冷道：宫主先走。你，留下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子的剑上带着一股阴风，剑过处连雾都裂开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.商玦.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "宫主下了崖。他不要我了，我也不要他了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.商玦.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子冷冷道：宫主已经走了。你追不上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "六阴剑"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.六阴剑.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "要练六阴剑，带着残卷来后山找我——不是现在。宫里的事还没完。你记住这条路。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.六阴剑.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "残卷不在你身上，谈什么六阴剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.六阴剑.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子冷笑：你也配问？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff moods.owed.chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子靠着后墙坐着，看着断崖，没有说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.headless_shade name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "无头黑影"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.headless_shade long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个人形的黑影，没有头。它的脖颈处是一片比夜更黑的空，两只手朝前伸着，一下一下地摸索。它不出声——它没有嘴。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "鬼卒"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个灰绿皮肤、面目狰狞的鬼卒，手里一柄钢叉。它的眼眶里没有眼珠，只有两点青火。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"鬼卒喝道：孽障！随我赴阴司受审吧。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"鬼卒的钢叉带起一股腥风。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner vanishes.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "鬼卒一声不响地散成一股黑烟，钢叉当啷掉在地上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，靠着甬道的石壁站着，腰上多了一把乌黑的钥匙，一只手一直按在上面。他听见脚步声就直起身来，先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士摸了摸腰上的钥匙，往西边那间牢房瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士低声道：子时……还有两个时辰。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士按住腰上的钥匙：大弟子刚丢下来的。子时开坛，你等着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士朝西边一偏头：西边那间。子时第一个就是他。"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/winch long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"野羊山北麓的崖顶。脚下就是那道裂口，一根粗麻绳从绞盘上绕下去，没进黑黝黝的口子里——山路转角的纳供就是从这里吊上来的。\n"
"吊上来的箱子在平台上堆了一人高，箱板上烙着「羊」字。北边一条货道沿着山脊往北麓去，尽头隐约是一片黑砖的屋脊。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/goods_path long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一条被车轮和脚印压实的货道，顺着北麓的山脊往北去。两旁是枯黄的长草和风化的黑灰色岩石，没有一棵像样的树。\n"
"路北头立着一座全用黑砖砌成的大道观，山门敞着，门里黑幡垂地；靠东有一条岔路绕向道观的东墙根。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/side_door long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"道观东墙根下的一块空地，车辙到这里为止。黑砖墙上开着一扇矮门，门楣上没有字，门槛磨得发白——供品是从这里进去的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/gatehouse long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的山门。黑砖砌的门楼有两丈高，门扇敞着，门洞里凉得像井底。两侧各挑着一盏暗红的灯笼，白天也点着。\n"
"门房的桌上摊着一本簿子，桌后坐着一个黑衣黑冠的道士。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/yard long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"黑砖铺地的大院子，踩上去没有一点声响。院当中一只黑铁香炉，烧的不是香，是一股子苦味。四面黑幡垂地，风过时幡上的字一闪一闪，看不清写的什么。\n"
"北边是前殿，殿门关着，推一推就开；东侧一排矮房是货栈。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/store long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间堆满箱笼的矮房，箱子上都烙着「羊」字，有的开着，露出金帛、腌肉和成捆的麻绳。角落里几只箱子钉得死紧，箱盖上用朱砂画着符。\n"
"南墙的矮门通向墙外，西边的门进前院。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/front long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的前殿。殿里没有神像，正中一张乌黑的长案，案上供的是一卷摊开的黑皮经书。五个黑衣黑冠的道士面壁跪在蒲团上诵经，领诵的敲着木鱼，一下一下，谁进来都不抬头。诵的字句一个也听不懂，只觉得殿里比外头冷。\n"
"西边一道门通丹房；北边的门紧闭着，门后隐约也有诵经声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/alchemy long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间烟气熏黑的屋子。正中一座三足的铜丹炉，炉火没有熄，炉口里的火苗是青的，不是红的。四壁的药架上摆满了罐子，罐子上贴的签子写的不是药名，是地名和日子。\n"
"东门回前殿，北门进账房；西南角上一道石阶往下，黑得看不见底。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/counting long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的账房，比丹房还小。一张乌木大案占了半间屋，案上摊着一本账册，旁边一叠盖了朱印的文书，压着一方乌黑的镇纸。墙上挂着算盘，算珠磨得发亮。\n"
"门在南边，通丹房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/corridor long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"丹房石阶底下的甬道，低得要弯腰。墙上一盏松油灯忽明忽暗，照着三扇铁栅门：西、北、东各一扇，锁都是新的。地上一层潮气，墙根有抓挠过的痕迹。\n"
"石阶在南边，上去是丹房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_huo long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头凿出来的牢房，只有一张草席、一只破碗。墙上用指甲刻了一排又一排的道道，数到一半刻不动了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_shitou long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头凿出来的牢房，比西边那间还小。草席上放着半块干饼，墙角摆着几颗排成一排的小石子，像是谁在玩。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_others long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头凿出来的牢房，两张草席并排铺着。墙上用炭画了一条河，河边画着一排小人在挖土。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/altar long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的后殿。殿里没有神像，正中一座黑石砌的坛，坛上一团黑焰无声地烧着，照不亮什么，只把坛边的影子拉得老长。四壁的黑幡比前殿的更高，幡上的字是暗红的，像血写的。\n"
"南门回前殿。坛后有一道黑门，门上一个字也没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/master long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"商玦的居所，比后殿暖，暖得不自然。一张乌木书案，案上笔墨整齐；靠墙一座书架，空了——架上的灰尘留着一排书脊的印子。案角一只黑匣，开着，里面什么也没有。\n"
"南边的黑门回后殿；北墙一扇小门，门外是风声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cliff_path long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫后山的崖径，窄得只容一人，一边是黑砖的后墙，一边是深不见底的崖。风从崖底上来，带着雾。崖径往北走到头是断崖。\n"
"南边的小门回宫主的居所。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cliff long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"崖径的尽头。一根绳索拴在崖边的铁桩上，另一头垂进雾里——绳子在三尺外被割断了，断口新得发白。再往前一步就是空的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.front.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "殿门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_huo.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "西牢房的铁栅门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_huo.door locked
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "铁栅门锁着，锁是新的，摇一摇纹丝不动。钥匙不在这里。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_shitou.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "北牢房的铁栅门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_shitou.door locked
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "铁栅门锁着。栅栏里的孩子往后缩了缩。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_others.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "东牢房的铁栅门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_others.door locked
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "铁栅门锁着。里面的人抬起头看了看你，又低下去。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.altar.door name
#: data/niling/world.json data/choyin/voxel/town.json
msgid "北门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.winch.rope act.verb
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "下到山路"
msgstr ""

#. niling.winch.rope act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你抓住麻绳，顺着裂口里的岩壁一点点溜下去。绳子磨得手心发烫，脚下终于踩到了山路的石头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "小门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.verb
#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.choice
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "追出去"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。崖径上空无一人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.ask
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "后门外是后山的崖径，商玦刚从这里出去。追出去，就赶不回地牢了——救人和追宫主，只来得及一件。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。崖径上有脚步声，往北去了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.winch.landmark.crates long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"吊上来的箱子堆了一人高，每只箱板上都烙着一个「羊」字——野羊寨的记号。箱缝里露出绸缎的一角，另一只箱子底下渗出暗红的水渍，闻着是腌肉的咸味，也许不是。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.banners name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑幡"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.banners long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"黑布的幡从一丈多高的杆子上垂到地，布面上用暗红的颜色写满了字，笔画横着走、竖着走，像是经文又像是符咒。风一过，字就一闪一闪地动，盯久了眼睛发酸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.burner name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "香炉"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.burner long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"一只齐腰高的黑铁香炉，炉口里烧着的不是香，是一把把黑色的碎末，冒着极淡的青烟，味道苦得呛人。炉身上铸着一圈无头的人形，手拉着手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.front.landmark.scripture name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "经书"
msgstr ""

#. niling.front.landmark.scripture long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"乌黑的长案上摊着一卷黑皮的经书，字是暗红的，横着走竖着走，和黑幡上的一样。你盯着看了一会儿，字像是在动，赶紧移开了眼。案角摆着一只木鱼，鱼身上的漆被敲掉了一块。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.alchemy.landmark.furnace long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"一座三足铜丹炉，炉身熏得乌黑。炉口的火苗是青色的，没有一点热气。炉边的托盘上摆着几颗乌黑的丹丸，闻着是一股说不出的腥甜。你不想知道它们是什么炼的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.alchemy.landmark.jars name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "药架"
msgstr ""

#. niling.alchemy.landmark.jars long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"药架上的罐子一只只封着口，签子上写的不是药名：「野羊 · 丁未秋」「关北 · 戊申冬」……有一只罐子的签子上写着「傅家坡 · 待」，罐子是空的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.corridor.landmark.scratches name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "刻痕"
msgstr ""

#. niling.corridor.landmark.scratches long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"西边那扇铁栅门里的墙根上，一排排指甲刻出来的道道，五个一组，刻了一百多组。最后一组只有三道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.altar.landmark.altar name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑石坛"
msgstr ""

#. niling.altar.landmark.altar long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"黑石砌成的坛，齐胸高，坛面磨得发亮。坛上烧着一团黑焰，没有温度，没有声音，凑近了看，焰心里像有东西在动。坛脚的石缝里塞着碎骨。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.landmark.shelf long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"空书架。灰尘上留着一排书脊的印子，最宽的那一道在正中。架子最底下掉着一页烧了一半的纸，只剩「逆灵」两个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.landmark.box name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑匣"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.landmark.box long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"一只黑漆木匣，开着。匣里垫着黑绒，绒上压出一个长条形的印子，像是放过一卷书——或者一把剑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cliff.landmark.rope long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"绳索被割断了，一头垂在雾里。断口整齐，是一剑。商玦就是从这里下去的，你没法跟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.1 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（初阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.1 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具硬木削成的练功木人，手臂和腰身装著机括，一碰便会还手。胸前贴著一张褪色的红纸，写著「初阶」两个字，是武馆给初学的弟子拆招用的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.1 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.2 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.3 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.4 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.5 accept_fight.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "身上的机括「咔嗒」一响，摆好了架势。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.2 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（二阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.2 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具硬木削成的练功木人，手臂和腰身装著机括，一碰便会还手。胸前的红纸写著「二阶」，木头上满是拳脚留下的印子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.3 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（三阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.3 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具铁木削成的练功木人，机括比旁边几具紧得多，还手又快又沉。胸前的红纸写著「三阶」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.4 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（四阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.4 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具铁木削成的练功木人，关节处包著铜皮，听说是柳馆主亲手调过机括的。胸前的红纸写著「四阶」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.5 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（五阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.5 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这具木人通体乌黑，是一整块铁木雕成的，机括藏在里头看不见。胸前的红纸写著「五阶」，武馆里能把它打得摇晃的人没有几个。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.1 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "流窜毛贼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.1 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个贼眉鼠眼的毛贼，衣衫上补丁叠著补丁，腰间却鼓鼓囊囊的，不知又从谁家摸来了什么。雪亭驿的告示上正画著他的像。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.2 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "剪径贼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.2 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个满脸横肉的汉子，专在山路上拦人剪径，不知劫过多少过往的客商。雪亭驿的告示上正画著他的像。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.3 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "采花贼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.3 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个油头粉面的年轻人，手里摇著一柄折扇，眼神却阴鸷得很。官府悬赏捉拿他已有好些日子了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.4 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "江洋大盗"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.4 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个虬髯大汉，身上带著好几处刀疤，据说在江北做过好几票大买卖，官府悬了重赏要他的人头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.5 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "杀人魔头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.5 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个面色青白的中年人，目光扫过来便叫人背脊发凉。告示上说他一夜之间屠了邻县一户人家，官府悬了最重的赏。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯策"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫营总教头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个鬓发斑白的老者，一身素白的武官袍服，腰背挺得笔直，坐在广场中间的木凳上不动如山。四面探头探脑的武林人没有一个敢靠得太近。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry topic
#. native.npc.song_pu inquiry topic
#. native.npc.white_officer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.courier inquiry topic
#. native.npc.onlooker inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "寻剑"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.寻剑.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大声点，让众位兄弟都听见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.寻剑.rules.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "信使一怔，随即大声说道：「方位是在西南二十四里，黄石隘口。」"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.黄石隘口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "那不是你该去的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "旋芒"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.旋芒
#. native.npc.white_officer inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "奉旨办差，闲人少问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宋朴"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫营副教头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦削的老者，白袍，坐在冯策身侧半步之后，眼睛半开半合，手里捏着一串核桃慢慢地转。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老夫只是陪冯总教头走一趟。寻剑的事，问他去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu inquiry.黄石隘口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "方位信使已经报过了，还问老夫？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.white_officer name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "白衣武官"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.white_officer long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个身著白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑，站得笔直，目不斜视。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "信使"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个风尘满面的信使，白袍下摆沾著泥点，刚从马上跳下来，气还没喘匀。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "下官只管传话。方位将军叫我当众报了，你也听见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "白道长"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier inquiry.白道长
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "白道长命下官回禀，说时辰已到。道长自己在何处，下官不敢说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "江湖客"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个风尘仆仆的江湖人，背著个长条布包，缩在广场边上探头探脑地往官队那边张望。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker inquiry.黄石隘口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "小兄弟也听见了？西南二十四里，黄石隘口。大内的人要去那儿找一把剑，咱们这些人……也想去瞧瞧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "听说是奉了皇上的旨，去岚城找什麽旋芒宝剑。岚城？谁知道在哪儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "太乙观观主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个须眉皆白的老道士，道袍洗得发灰，一柄拂尘搭在臂弯上。他站在山壁下新挖开的土坑边，眼睛一直盯着坑里，官兵们挖一锹，他的眉头就皱一分。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.石匣
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "那不是什么宝剑，是岚城的风铃。寻风的人才用得上，旁人开了，只会招祸。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "风铃"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.风铃
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "岚城的东西，岚城的风才送得到。老道只知道这些。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.黑衣道士
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠黑衣，一身邪气，这一带没有这样的道观。他往老松岭去了——拾起他掉的那块布条看看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯总教头奉旨寻的是旋芒宝剑。老道陪他走这一趟，是怕他们挖出不该挖的东西。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.老松寨
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老松岭上的匪寨。那道士慌忙间掉了块布条，上头刻的就是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "一名白衣武官从山壁下的土坑里捧出一只尺许长的石匣，匣面刻着一圈风纹。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "总教头，挖出来了！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "打开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯总教头，匣子开不得。这是岚城的风铃，寻风的人才用得上，旁人开了，只会招祸。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "崖上忽然一道黑影掠下，一个黑衣黑冠的道士落在土坑边，一把抢过石匣，转身便往山壁上纵去！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "多谢诸位代劳！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣道士衣角一扯，一块布条飘落在地。他几个起落，已经翻上山壁，往北面的老松岭去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "追！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "回过头来，目光落在你身上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "这不是你该来的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "小友，那道士往老松岭去了。他慌忙间掉了一块布条——你拾起来看看，那上头是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist_pass long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，瘦得颧骨突出，眼神鬼鬼祟祟的。他怀里紧紧抱着一只石匣。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist_pass inquiry.石匣
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "滚开！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，瘦得颧骨突出，眼神鬼鬼祟祟的。他蹲在那具骸骨旁边，石匣摆在脚边，正掰下一根指骨往匣口的缝里捅，捅一下，骂一声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist greeting.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你也是来寻风铃的？晚了！这骨头开不了匣子，你的骨头说不定行。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑衣道士尖声道：宫里的人很快就到，你跑不了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑衣道士一边招架一边往洞口瞟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist spared.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣道士捂着伤口翻身爬起，连滚带爬地逃出了山洞，往北边去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "押车道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽到肘上，手里攥着一根粗麻绳，绳子的另一头没进北边山壁的裂口里。他盯着车上的箱子，不看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist greeting.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "此处无路，施主请回。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry.纳供
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "道士头也不抬：野羊寨的供，与你何干。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "道士拉绳的手停了一停：施主听谁说的这个名字？……回去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry.裂口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "道士冷冷道：上头没有路，有也不是给你走的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"押车道士厉声道：野羊寨的供都敢劫，不要命了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"押车道士往裂口上头喊了一声，上面没有人应。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山二寨主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄脱了门房的青布衫，换回了一身短打，单刀挂在腰上。他靠着土地庙的柱子，像是回到了自己的地方——只是看人的眼神还带着当门房时的那股子躲闪。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄擦着单刀，没有抬头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄朝里屋喊了一声：大哥，酒来了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "回寨"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.回寨
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄道：大哥回来了，老子还在雪亭镇看什么门。淳风武馆的门房，让他们另找人吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.霍铮
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄道：大哥在里屋。他说你横着走，那就横着走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄啐了一口：那群牛鼻子的账，野羊寨记着。等大哥养好了身子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "血手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.血手
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄沉默了一会儿：血手刘三是老子。老子认。你放过我一回，野羊寨欠你两条命。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.黄霸
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄压低声音：老三纳供的事，大哥没追究。老子也不说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "东方神教杀手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙着面，眉眼看起来有些面熟——书房里那个老妇人的眉眼。衣襟上有血，不是她的。她站在前厅正中，像在等人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙面杀手说：衣不在了，这庄还守什么？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer moods.seen.chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙面杀手看着你，没再出手。面巾下的眼睛和书房里那个老妇人一样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "庾家管事"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿酱色便衣的中年人，腰里的刀用布裹着，手搭在上头。他不像是来喝酒的——眼睛在街上扫，扫到陈显祖就停了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事的手在刀柄的布上摩挲了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事喝道：拿下！人要活的！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事说道：兵部有令，拦的人一并拿！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "从酒楼对面的屋檐下走出来，拦在街心。身后三个便衣的汉子散开，手都按着刀柄。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "陈显祖，兵部有令拿你。箱子留下，人跟我们走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "站住了，手慢慢按到剑柄上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年了，还是找来了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "动手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"三个汉子抽刀围了上来——冲的是你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward moods.fighting.chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事的刀出了布。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "庾家打手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个便衣的壮汉，刀已经出了鞘。酱色的短衣，和管事一个颜色。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家打手喝道：让开！我们拿的是逃兵，不是你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家打手的刀横着扫过来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一位相貌威武的武官，坐在内厅的茶桌旁，鬓角白了。他不再发呆了——二十年压在身上的东西，在堂上说出来之后，人反倒直了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"陈显祖端起茶，手不抖了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"陈显祖说道：二十三个名字，我一个一个念过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "在下陈显祖。如今是乔阴县衙的人证——总算是个名目。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.供词
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我说了：原令只一句，「寻剑，不得扰民一户」。征民夫、拿人的，不是先帝的令。程大人都录下了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.寻剑令
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前念给全队听的那一卷，我抄了一份，藏到今天。该念给公堂听了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.槐阳王
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "程大人的叔父。听说老王爷拒过兵部的令——有人肯拒，我这份供词就不算白说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.箱子
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "箱子还给我了，书也给了你。里头最要紧的东西，如今在程大人的卷宗里。"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_chen name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "雪亭驿的书信"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_chen long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封封好的书信，信封上写着：绮云镇 振远镖局 陈剑秋 亲启。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/cloth_strip name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "刻着记号的布条"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/cloth_strip long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一截粗麻布条，像是从衣角撕下来的，上面用刀尖刻着一个歪歪扭扭的记号：一棵松、三道横。老松岭一带的人管这叫老松寨的记号。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:waterfog/guild_token name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "水烟阁武士腰牌"
msgstr ""

#. native:waterfog/guild_token long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一面黄铜腰牌，正面铸着一只展翅的金乌，背面刻着「水烟阁」三字和一个「岭」字。铜面发黑，边角磨得发亮，不知在谁身上挂了多少年。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_pan name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "柳淳风的引荐信"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_pan long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封封好的信，封皮上写着「水烟阁 潘军禅贤弟 亲启」，落款「柳淳风」。封口的火漆上印着一枝柳。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:cloud/escort_note name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "二十年前的镖单"
msgstr ""

#. native:cloud/escort_note long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一张发黄的镖单，振远镖局的印鉴已经模糊。所押之物写着：水烟阁盟主印一方，密件一匣。起运地关北，收件人水烟阁盟主卫沧澜。末尾一行小字：乙丑年失镖于老松岭瀑布一带，镖师随从无一人生还。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "刻着风纹的石匣"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一只尺许长的青石匣子，匣面刻着一圈风纹，匣口严丝合缝，看不出锁眼在哪里。摇一摇，里面有极轻的一声响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:goathill/tribute_cart name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "纳供车"
msgstr ""

#. native:goathill/tribute_cart long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一辆双轮板车，车上盖着油布，油布底下露出几只箱子的角。车辕上拴着一根粗麻绳，绳子绷得笔直，一头没进北边山壁的裂口里——上头有人在拉。车板上烙着一个「羊」字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:goathill/tribute_cart unit
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "辆"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/cold_robe name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "寒於宝衣"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/cold_robe long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一件月白的衣，料子像结了霜的水，摸上去不冷，站在它旁边却觉得凉。衣襟里缝着一行小字：寒於留衣，月神守之，火不能近。守衣人瑷伦说，它挡得住黑焰——几百年没人试过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_maid name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "婢女的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_maid long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一个婢女倒在前厅的地上，手里还攥着抹布。喉下一道细口，是极细的剑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_zhaorong name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "昭蓉的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_zhaorong long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"昭蓉倒在内厅的门边，像是听见前厅的动静跑出来，没跑到。她的手还搭在门框上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/decree_copy name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "寻剑令抄本"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/decree_copy long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一卷发黄的纸，边角磨得起了毛，叠过又展开过许多回。抄的是二十年前兵部颁下的寻剑令，一句：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」底下另起一行，密密地写着一队人的名字——二十三个，每个名字后头点了一个墨点，像在数人。最后一个名字是陈显祖，没有点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/magistrate_letter name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "程不平的信"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/magistrate_letter long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封封好的信，火漆上压着乔阴县印，封皮写着「叔父大人亲启」。程不平说：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的；假印和失踪的人都往关北去了——这封信替你敲开天驼关军营的门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/pine_top long
#: data/native/rooms.json
msgid ""
"破旧的栈道到这里到了头。崖上的松树比下面密得多，树冠遮去了大半天光，\n"
"地上一条踩出来的小径往东去，南边树隙间透着山涧的水声，北边的林子更深。\n"
"小径旁好几株松树的树干上有刀划的记号。\n"
msgstr ""

